asr-000024
00:03:53.950 --> 00:04:01.170
Rep. Ian Paul L. Dy: Thank you. I would like to read the opening remarks. First of all, I would like to welcome

asr-000025
00:04:01.170 --> 00:04:07.670
Rep. Ian Paul L. Dy: all the Department of Agrarian Reform headed by Secretary Estrella. Good morning to everyone.

asr-000026
00:04:08.310 --> 00:04:13.210
Rep. Ian Paul L. Dy: I would like to read the opening remarks now of Representative Mikaela Swan Singh.

asr-000027
00:04:14.250 --> 00:04:19.430
Rep. Ian Paul L. Dy: Honorable members of the Committee on Appropriations, Secretary Conrad Estrella III

asr-000028
00:04:19.430 --> 00:04:22.590
Rep. Ian Paul L. Dy: and esteemed guests from the Department of Agrarian Reform,

asr-000029
00:04:22.590 --> 00:04:28.030
Rep. Ian Paul L. Dy: Distinguished colleagues and fellow public servants, magandang umaga po inyong lahat.

asr-000030
00:04:28.510 --> 00:04:31.330
Rep. Ian Paul L. Dy: As the lead agency tasked with implementing genuine

asr-000031
00:04:31.330 --> 00:04:37.550
Rep. Ian Paul L. Dy: and comprehensive agrarian reform, the Department of Agrarian Reform remains steadfast in advancing

asr-000032
00:04:37.550 --> 00:04:44.570
Rep. Ian Paul L. Dy: the redistribution of land to farmer beneficiaries. This mandate is anchored on the Comprehensive

asr-000033
00:04:44.570 --> 00:04:50.950
Rep. Ian Paul L. Dy: Agrarian Reform Program and reinforced by landmark measures such as the New Agrarian

asr-000034
00:04:50.950 --> 00:04:58.630
Rep. Ian Paul L. Dy: Emancipation Act, Republic Act 11953, which has delivered historic, tangible results.

asr-000035
00:04:59.750 --> 00:05:06.210
Rep. Ian Paul L. Dy: In his recent directives, President Ferdinand Marcos Jr. has continuously underscored DAR's

asr-000036
00:05:06.210 --> 00:05:12.170
Rep. Ian Paul L. Dy: crucial role in fast-tracking the distribution of land titles, whether through certificates

asr-000037
00:05:12.170 --> 00:05:17.630
Rep. Ian Paul L. Dy: of land ownership award, the CLOAS, electronic titles, or COCROMs.

asr-000038
00:05:17.630 --> 00:05:23.230
Rep. Ian Paul L. Dy: These initiatives are designed to secure farmer ownership and provide lasting relief from

asr-000039
00:05:23.230 --> 00:05:24.110
Rep. Ian Paul L. Dy: agrarian debt.

asr-000040
00:05:24.710 --> 00:05:30.990
Rep. Ian Paul L. Dy: As of August 12, 2026, the Department has reported that the debt condonation process

asr-000041
00:05:30.990 --> 00:05:39.410
Rep. Ian Paul L. Dy: under this law has successfully distributed a total of 703,047 certificates of condonation

asr-000042
00:05:39.410 --> 00:05:47.330
Rep. Ian Paul L. Dy: with release of mortgage, these are our COCROMs, covering 901,246 hectares.

asr-000043
00:05:47.630 --> 00:05:52.910
Rep. Ian Paul L. Dy: of land and freeing hundreds of thousands

asr-000044
00:05:52.910 --> 00:06:00.710
Rep. Ian Paul L. Dy: of agrarian reform beneficiaries from a massive 54.7 billion in unpaid debts, fully enabling

asr-000045
00:06:00.710 --> 00:06:05.750
Rep. Ian Paul L. Dy: them to cultivate the lands they till as free and empowered landowners.

asr-000046
00:06:06.730 --> 00:06:17.370
Rep. Ian Paul L. Dy: For fiscal year 2027, the NEP proposed a budget of 14.691 billion, representing approximately

asr-000047
00:06:17.630 --> 00:06:21.370
Rep. Ian Paul L. Dy: of the proposed ₱7.2 trillion national budget.

asr-000048
00:06:22.150 --> 00:06:27.910
Rep. Ian Paul L. Dy: This budget is strategically allocated with $3.373 billion

asr-000049
00:06:27.910 --> 00:06:30.310
Rep. Ian Paul L. Dy: for land tenure security program

asr-000050
00:06:30.310 --> 00:06:39.090
Rep. Ian Paul L. Dy: or 22.96% of the total agency budget of $1.29 billion,

asr-000051
00:06:39.710 --> 00:06:44.330
Rep. Ian Paul L. Dy: which is 8.23% for agrarian justice delivery program

asr-000052
00:06:44.330 --> 00:06:49.570
Rep. Ian Paul L. Dy: and $2.477 billion, 16.86%

asr-000053
00:06:49.570 --> 00:06:54.130
Rep. Ian Paul L. Dy: for agrarian reform beneficiaries development and support program.

asr-000054
00:06:55.150 --> 00:06:59.370
Rep. Ian Paul L. Dy: This allocation embodies DAR's commitment not only to distribute land

asr-000055
00:06:59.370 --> 00:07:04.470
Rep. Ian Paul L. Dy: but also to transform beneficiaries into empowered, self-reliant,

asr-000056
00:07:04.910 --> 00:07:07.590
Rep. Ian Paul L. Dy: and productive stewards of their communities.

asr-000057
00:07:08.350 --> 00:07:11.830
Rep. Ian Paul L. Dy: This committee anticipates a clear and comprehensive presentation

asr-000058
00:07:11.830 --> 00:07:14.310
Rep. Ian Paul L. Dy: that will demonstrate how last year's approach

asr-000059
00:07:14.310 --> 00:07:16.810
Rep. Ian Paul L. Dy: to land appropriations were maximized

asr-000060
00:07:16.810 --> 00:07:20.810
Rep. Ian Paul L. Dy: and how this proposed budget will translate into measurable gains,

asr-000061
00:07:20.810 --> 00:07:23.310
Rep. Ian Paul L. Dy: ensuring secure land tenure,

asr-000062
00:07:23.310 --> 00:07:27.810
Rep. Ian Paul L. Dy: protecting the rights and welfare of farmer beneficiaries,

asr-000063
00:07:27.810 --> 00:07:31.810
Rep. Ian Paul L. Dy: and improving the quality of life in agrarian reformed communities.

asr-000064
00:07:32.310 --> 00:07:36.310
Rep. Ian Paul L. Dy: On that note, before the agency begins its presentations,

asr-000065
00:07:36.310 --> 00:07:39.310
Rep. Ian Paul L. Dy: I would like to introduce, which is myself,

asr-000066
00:07:39.310 --> 00:07:44.310
Rep. Ian Paul L. Dy: the sponsor of DAR's budget, Vice Chairperson Representative Ian Dy.

asr-000067
00:07:44.810 --> 00:07:46.810
Rep. Ian Paul L. Dy: Let us now proceed to the presentation

asr-000068
00:07:46.810 --> 00:07:50.810
Rep. Ian Paul L. Dy: of the Secretary of the Department of Agrarian Reform's proposed budget

asr-000069
00:07:50.810 --> 00:07:53.310
Rep. Ian Paul L. Dy: for fiscal year 2027.

asr-000070
00:07:53.310 --> 00:07:54.310
Rep. Ian Paul L. Dy: Thank you.

asr-000071
00:07:58.450 --> 00:08:00.950
Rep. Ian Paul L. Dy: Secretary Conrad Estrella,

asr-000072
00:08:01.450 --> 00:08:04.450
Rep. Ian Paul L. Dy: you may now proceed with your presentation.

asr-000073
00:08:04.450 --> 00:08:05.450
Rep. Ian Paul L. Dy: Thank you.

asr-000074
00:08:05.450 --> 00:08:07.450
DAR Secretary Conrado M. Estrella III: Thank you, Mr. Chairman.

asr-000075
00:08:08.450 --> 00:08:11.950
DAR Secretary Conrado M. Estrella III: Distinguished Deputy Speakers,

asr-000076
00:08:11.950 --> 00:08:16.450
DAR Secretary Conrado M. Estrella III: our partners in service to the people,

asr-000077
00:08:17.450 --> 00:08:19.950
DAR Secretary Conrado M. Estrella III: from the legislative branch,

asr-000078
00:08:19.950 --> 00:08:23.950
DAR Secretary Conrado M. Estrella III: both from the minority and the majority,

asr-000079
00:08:23.950 --> 00:08:25.950
DAR Secretary Conrado M. Estrella III: my former colleagues,

asr-000080
00:08:28.450 --> 00:08:32.450
DAR Secretary Conrado M. Estrella III: I still breathe the same air when I'm here.

asr-000081
00:08:32.950 --> 00:08:34.450
DAR Secretary Conrado M. Estrella III: I still feel at home.

asr-000082
00:08:34.450 --> 00:08:36.450
DAR Secretary Conrado M. Estrella III: Good morning to all of you.

asr-000083
00:08:38.450 --> 00:08:42.450
DAR Secretary Conrado M. Estrella III: It is without most respect and gratitude that we present the Department

asr-000084
00:08:42.950 --> 00:08:46.450
DAR Secretary Conrado M. Estrella III: of Agrarian Reform's proposed budget for fiscal year

asr-000085
00:08:46.450 --> 00:08:48.450
DAR Secretary Conrado M. Estrella III: 2027.

asr-000086
00:08:49.450 --> 00:08:55.360
DAR Secretary Conrado M. Estrella III: Allow me to begin a directive from His Excellency,

asr-000087
00:08:55.360 --> 00:08:58.360
DAR Secretary Conrado M. Estrella III: President Ferdinand R. Marcos, Jr.

asr-000088
00:08:58.360 --> 00:09:02.360
DAR Secretary Conrado M. Estrella III: during his 2026 State of the Nation Address.

asr-000089
00:09:02.860 --> 00:09:04.360
DAR Secretary Conrado M. Estrella III: Ang sabi niya,

asr-000090
00:09:04.360 --> 00:09:08.360
DAR Secretary Conrado M. Estrella III: Asahan ninyo, kukumpletuhin na natin ngayong taon

asr-000091
00:09:08.860 --> 00:09:11.860
DAR Secretary Conrado M. Estrella III: ang ginagawa nating pagpapawalang-bisa

asr-000092
00:09:11.860 --> 00:09:15.860
DAR Secretary Conrado M. Estrella III: sa mga utang ng ating mga benepisyaryo.

asr-000093
00:09:15.860 --> 00:09:21.860
DAR Secretary Conrado M. Estrella III: This directive gives clear direction to the Department of Agrarian Reform.

asr-000094
00:09:21.860 --> 00:09:28.860
DAR Secretary Conrado M. Estrella III: The President has entrusted us with a very specific and urgent responsibility

asr-000095
00:09:28.860 --> 00:09:33.860
DAR Secretary Conrado M. Estrella III: to fulfill the mandate of the law by completing this year

asr-000096
00:09:33.860 --> 00:09:39.860
DAR Secretary Conrado M. Estrella III: the debt condonation process for our agrarian reform beneficiaries.

asr-000097
00:09:39.860 --> 00:09:44.360
DAR Secretary Conrado M. Estrella III: This is anchored on Republic Act Number 11953,

asr-000098
00:09:44.360 --> 00:09:48.360
DAR Secretary Conrado M. Estrella III: or the new Agrarian Emancipation Act,

asr-000099
00:09:48.360 --> 00:09:53.360
DAR Secretary Conrado M. Estrella III: which institutionalized the condonation of the unpaid amortizations,

asr-000100
00:09:53.360 --> 00:09:57.360
DAR Secretary Conrado M. Estrella III: interest, penalties, and other related obligations

asr-000101
00:09:57.360 --> 00:10:01.360
DAR Secretary Conrado M. Estrella III: of qualified agrarian reform beneficiaries.

asr-000102
00:10:01.360 --> 00:10:04.360
DAR Secretary Conrado M. Estrella III: And by the way, may I take this opportunity,

asr-000103
00:10:04.360 --> 00:10:09.360
DAR Secretary Conrado M. Estrella III: ladies and gentlemen, honorable members of the Appropriations Committee,

asr-000104
00:10:09.360 --> 00:10:13.360
DAR Secretary Conrado M. Estrella III: to congratulate each and every one of you,

asr-000105
00:10:13.360 --> 00:10:19.360
DAR Secretary Conrado M. Estrella III: because this is the accomplishment also of the House of Representatives,

asr-000106
00:10:19.360 --> 00:10:23.360
DAR Secretary Conrado M. Estrella III: which, when this was proposed as a bill and debated upon,

asr-000107
00:10:23.360 --> 00:10:26.360
DAR Secretary Conrado M. Estrella III: nobody went against it,

asr-000108
00:10:26.360 --> 00:10:31.360
DAR Secretary Conrado M. Estrella III: and that there was unanimous voting for this measure.

asr-000109
00:10:31.360 --> 00:10:33.360
DAR Secretary Conrado M. Estrella III: So thank you, ladies and gentlemen.

asr-000110
00:10:35.360 --> 00:10:43.080
DAR Secretary Conrado M. Estrella III: Our directive today is rooted in a long legacy of agrarian reform.

asr-000111
00:10:43.080 --> 00:10:45.080
DAR Secretary Conrado M. Estrella III: On September 26,

asr-000112
00:10:45.080 --> 00:10:47.080
DAR Secretary Conrado M. Estrella III: 1972,

asr-000113
00:10:47.080 --> 00:10:49.080
DAR Secretary Conrado M. Estrella III: Presidential Decree Number 2

asr-000114
00:10:49.080 --> 00:10:53.080
DAR Secretary Conrado M. Estrella III: declared the entire Philippines a land reform area,

asr-000115
00:10:53.080 --> 00:11:00.080
DAR Secretary Conrado M. Estrella III: followed on October 21 by Presidential Decree 27,

asr-000116
00:11:00.080 --> 00:11:03.080
DAR Secretary Conrado M. Estrella III: the Tenant Emancipation Decree,

asr-000117
00:11:03.080 --> 00:11:09.080
DAR Secretary Conrado M. Estrella III: which sought to emancipate tenant farmers by transferring ownership of the land they tilled.

asr-000118
00:11:09.080 --> 00:11:11.080
DAR Secretary Conrado M. Estrella III: At that time,

asr-000119
00:11:11.080 --> 00:11:15.080
DAR Secretary Conrado M. Estrella III: my grandfather, the late Minister Conrado F. Estrella,

asr-000120
00:11:15.080 --> 00:11:21.080
DAR Secretary Conrado M. Estrella III: worked alongside the late President Ferdinand E. Marcos,

asr-000121
00:11:21.080 --> 00:11:25.080
DAR Secretary Conrado M. Estrella III: in advancing this historic reform.

asr-000122
00:11:25.080 --> 00:11:28.080
DAR Secretary Conrado M. Estrella III: More than five decades later,

asr-000123
00:11:28.080 --> 00:11:31.080
DAR Secretary Conrado M. Estrella III: on July 7, 2023,

asr-000124
00:11:31.080 --> 00:11:36.080
DAR Secretary Conrado M. Estrella III: Republic Act 11953, or the new Agrarian Emancipation Act,

asr-000125
00:11:36.080 --> 00:11:38.080
DAR Secretary Conrado M. Estrella III: continued this legacy.

asr-000126
00:11:38.080 --> 00:11:39.080
DAR Secretary Conrado M. Estrella III: And today,

asr-000127
00:11:39.080 --> 00:11:42.080
DAR Secretary Conrado M. Estrella III: President Ferdinand R. Marcos,

asr-000128
00:11:42.080 --> 00:11:43.080
DAR Secretary Conrado M. Estrella III: and I,

asr-000129
00:11:43.080 --> 00:11:46.080
DAR Secretary Conrado M. Estrella III: carry this responsibility forward,

asr-000130
00:11:46.080 --> 00:11:49.080
DAR Secretary Conrado M. Estrella III: from land distribution and debt condonation

asr-000131
00:11:49.080 --> 00:11:56.070
DAR Secretary Conrado M. Estrella III: to agrarian justice and the empowerment of our farmers.

asr-000132
00:11:56.070 --> 00:11:59.070
DAR Secretary Conrado M. Estrella III: The years 2022

asr-000133
00:11:59.070 --> 00:12:01.070
DAR Secretary Conrado M. Estrella III: to 2026

asr-000134
00:12:01.070 --> 00:12:08.070
DAR Secretary Conrado M. Estrella III: may aptly be described as banner years for the Department of Agrarian Reform.

asr-000135
00:12:08.070 --> 00:12:11.070
DAR Secretary Conrado M. Estrella III: In 2022,

asr-000136
00:12:11.070 --> 00:12:14.070
DAR Secretary Conrado M. Estrella III: there at the beginning of this administration,

asr-000137
00:12:14.070 --> 00:12:20.070
DAR Secretary Conrado M. Estrella III: DAR immediately strengthened the implementation of its core mandate.

asr-000138
00:12:20.070 --> 00:12:27.070
DAR Secretary Conrado M. Estrella III: We were able to distribute 21,876 land titles,

asr-000139
00:12:27.070 --> 00:12:33.070
DAR Secretary Conrado M. Estrella III: covering approximately 25,159 hectares

asr-000140
00:12:33.070 --> 00:12:40.070
DAR Secretary Conrado M. Estrella III: and benefiting 24,804 agrarian reform beneficiaries.

asr-000141
00:12:40.070 --> 00:12:43.070
DAR Secretary Conrado M. Estrella III: This represented a 124% increase

asr-000142
00:12:43.070 --> 00:12:50.070
DAR Secretary Conrado M. Estrella III: over the baseline period,

asr-000143
00:12:50.070 --> 00:12:54.070
DAR Secretary Conrado M. Estrella III: comparing it to the previous administrations,

asr-000144
00:12:54.070 --> 00:12:55.070
DAR Secretary Conrado M. Estrella III: Your Honors.

asr-000145
00:12:55.070 --> 00:12:59.070
DAR Secretary Conrado M. Estrella III: I-lay din natin 'yung basis natin

asr-000146
00:12:59.070 --> 00:13:03.070
DAR Secretary Conrado M. Estrella III: from previous administration kasi 'yung dinistribute

asr-000147
00:13:03.070 --> 00:13:06.070
DAR Secretary Conrado M. Estrella III: nilang land titles is the same with what we have distributed

asr-000148
00:13:06.070 --> 00:13:09.070
DAR Secretary Conrado M. Estrella III: in six months only.

asr-000149
00:13:09.070 --> 00:13:12.070
DAR Secretary Conrado M. Estrella III: Their accomplishment in the previous year

asr-000150
00:13:12.070 --> 00:13:16.070
DAR Secretary Conrado M. Estrella III: for a period of one year and three months.

asr-000151
00:13:18.160 --> 00:13:20.950
DAR Secretary Conrado M. Estrella III: Pumareho lang ho kami,

asr-000152
00:13:20.950 --> 00:13:23.920
DAR Secretary Conrado M. Estrella III: ngunit six months lang ho namin inimplement.

asr-000153
00:13:23.920 --> 00:13:26.000
DAR Secretary Conrado M. Estrella III: At the same time,

asr-000154
00:13:26.000 --> 00:13:28.630
DAR Secretary Conrado M. Estrella III: DAR reinforced its legal service system

asr-000155
00:13:28.630 --> 00:13:31.920
DAR Secretary Conrado M. Estrella III: and strengthened its rural development campaign.

asr-000156
00:13:31.920 --> 00:13:33.480
DAR Secretary Conrado M. Estrella III: This early momentum

asr-000157
00:13:33.480 --> 00:13:36.480
DAR Secretary Conrado M. Estrella III: was significant

asr-000158
00:13:36.480 --> 00:13:38.480
DAR Secretary Conrado M. Estrella III: because it demonstrated that

asr-000159
00:13:38.480 --> 00:13:41.480
DAR Secretary Conrado M. Estrella III: agrarian reform would remain a priority

asr-000160
00:13:41.480 --> 00:13:44.480
DAR Secretary Conrado M. Estrella III: under this administration.

asr-000161
00:13:44.480 --> 00:13:46.480
DAR Secretary Conrado M. Estrella III: It also provided the foundation

asr-000162
00:13:46.480 --> 00:13:49.480
DAR Secretary Conrado M. Estrella III: for much more ambitious reform

asr-000163
00:13:49.480 --> 00:13:51.480
DAR Secretary Conrado M. Estrella III: fulfilling the President's commitment

asr-000164
00:13:51.480 --> 00:13:55.480
DAR Secretary Conrado M. Estrella III: to free our farmers from agrarian debt.

asr-000165
00:13:56.480 --> 00:13:58.480
DAR Secretary Conrado M. Estrella III: In 2023,

asr-000166
00:13:58.480 --> 00:14:01.480
DAR Secretary Conrado M. Estrella III: a historic milestone was achieved.

asr-000167
00:14:01.480 --> 00:14:04.480
DAR Secretary Conrado M. Estrella III: Republic Act No. 11953

asr-000168
00:14:04.480 --> 00:14:07.480
DAR Secretary Conrado M. Estrella III: or the new Agrarian Emancipation Act

asr-000169
00:14:07.480 --> 00:14:09.480
DAR Secretary Conrado M. Estrella III: was signed into law.

asr-000170
00:14:09.480 --> 00:14:10.480
DAR Secretary Conrado M. Estrella III: A landmark measure

asr-000171
00:14:10.480 --> 00:14:12.480
DAR Secretary Conrado M. Estrella III: that was acted upon swiftly

asr-000172
00:14:12.480 --> 00:14:14.480
DAR Secretary Conrado M. Estrella III: by our legislators

asr-000173
00:14:14.480 --> 00:14:16.480
DAR Secretary Conrado M. Estrella III: and received broad support

asr-000174
00:14:16.480 --> 00:14:18.480
DAR Secretary Conrado M. Estrella III: reflecting our shared commitment

