asr-000400
00:22:35.230 --> 00:22:50.110
DAR Secretary Conrado M. Estrella III: This sustained increase demonstrates the Department's determination to accelerate land distribution and provide beneficiaries with stronger tenure security.

asr-000401
00:22:51.370 --> 00:22:56.150
