asr-000405
00:23:35.230 --> 00:23:42.030
DAR Secretary Conrado M. Estrella III: And approximately 57.76 billion in agrarian debt.

asr-000406
00:23:42.610 --> 00:23:50.290
DAR Secretary Conrado M. Estrella III: As we move toward completion, the Department remains focused on reaching every qualified beneficiary covered by the law.

asr-000407
00:23:51.150 --> 00:24:01.350
