asr-000409
00:24:09.360 --> 00:24:16.220
DAR Secretary Conrado M. Estrella III: With regards to agrarian justice delivery, the second pillar is agrarian justice delivery.

asr-000410
00:24:17.020 --> 00:24:29.740
DAR Secretary Conrado M. Estrella III: Agrarian reform cannot be complete if farmers have land but cannot obtain timely and accessible justice when disputes arise.

asr-000411
00:24:29.740 --> 00:24:38.420
DAR Secretary Conrado M. Estrella III: The Department therefore continues to strengthen its legal mechanisms to ensure that the agrarian disputes are resolved fairly,

asr-000412
00:24:38.780 --> 00:24:39.340
