DAR Secretary Conrado M. Estrella III: their land productive and

asr-000530
00:29:56.080 --> 00:29:58.080
DAR Secretary Conrado M. Estrella III: their organizations sustainable.

asr-000531
00:29:58.080 --> 00:29:59.720
DAR Secretary Conrado M. Estrella III: Under this pillar,

asr-000532
00:29:59.720 --> 00:30:10.040
DAR Secretary Conrado M. Estrella III: DAR continues to provide support that enables our farmers not only to own land, but to make a viable and sustainable livelihood from it.

asr-000533
00:30:11.000 --> 00:30:14.700
DAR Secretary Conrado M. Estrella III: One of the important forms of support is irrigation.

asr-000534
00:30:14.700 --> 00:30:28.980
DAR Secretary Conrado M. Estrella III: From July 2022 to July 2026, DAR has facilitated 285 irrigation projects, of which 233 have been completed and 52 are ongoing.

asr-000535
00:30:28.980 --> 00:30:45.080
DAR Secretary Conrado M. Estrella III: These projects amount to P5.02 billion covering 34,711.74 hectares and benefiting 40,775 farmer beneficiaries.

asr-000536
00:30:46.480 --> 00:30:58.960
DAR Secretary Conrado M. Estrella III: Importantly, the majority of these irrigation facilities are solar-powered, providing a more sustainable and cost-efficient source of water.

asr-000537
00:30:58.980 --> 00:31:14.900
DAR Secretary Conrado M. Estrella III: Beyond increasing productivity, these also help reduce the time and effort required for water access, particularly for women involved in farming and household activities.

asr-000538
00:31:14.900 --> 00:31:27.900
DAR Secretary Conrado M. Estrella III: Through reliable and sustainable water infrastructure, we help farmers improve production, reduce vulnerability to weather conditions, and maximize the productive potential.

asr-000539
00:31:28.980 --> 00:31:36.780
DAR Secretary Conrado M. Estrella III: We have also continued to improve physical connectivity through farm-to-market roads.

asr-000540
00:31:36.780 --> 00:31:58.700
DAR Secretary Conrado M. Estrella III: From July 2022 to July 2026, DAR has completed 537 farm-to-market roads nationwide, covering a total distance of 435.807 kilometers and benefiting 155,123 agrarian reform.

asr-000541
00:31:58.980 --> 00:32:13.660
DAR Secretary Conrado M. Estrella III: There are also 89 ongoing projects covering approximately 108.351 kilometers and benefiting 26,953 ARBs.

asr-000542
00:32:14.620 --> 00:32:24.800
DAR Secretary Conrado M. Estrella III: These roads help address one of the persistent challenges faced by farmers, bringing their produce from the farm to the market.

asr-000543
00:32:25.640 --> 00:32:28.800
DAR Secretary Conrado M. Estrella III: Better connectivity means reduced transport costs.

asr-000544
00:32:28.980 --> 00:32:37.780
DAR Secretary Conrado M. Estrella III: Transportation difficulties improve access to markets and greater opportunities for our beneficiaries to increase their income.

asr-000545
00:32:38.780 --> 00:32:48.240
DAR Secretary Conrado M. Estrella III: Modern agriculture requires modern tools.

asr-000546
00:32:48.240 --> 00:33:02.240
DAR Secretary Conrado M. Estrella III: As part of our support services, DAR has distributed 13,009 farm machineries and equipment, including support facilities, benefiting 3,207 agrarian reform beneficiaries.

asr-000547
00:33:03.140 --> 00:33:20.740
DAR Secretary Conrado M. Estrella III: These interventions are intended to improve productivity, reduce production costs, and strengthen the capacity of ARB organizations to undertake agricultural activities at a more efficient and competitive scale.

asr-000548
00:33:20.740 --> 00:33:33.000
DAR Secretary Conrado M. Estrella III: Our objective is to ensure that the land awarded to our beneficiaries is supported by the appropriate resources to make it productive and sustainable.

asr-000549
00:33:33.140 --> 00:33:43.440
DAR Secretary Conrado M. Estrella III: Capacity building remains as one of the most important investments we make for our agrarian reform beneficiaries.

asr-000550
00:33:43.440 --> 00:33:56.700
DAR Secretary Conrado M. Estrella III: From July 2022 to July 2026, DAR recorded 1,605,635 training participants in terms of service count.

asr-000551
00:33:57.480 --> 00:33:59.320
DAR Secretary Conrado M. Estrella III: This training goes beyond seminars.

asr-000552
00:33:59.560 --> 00:34:02.880
DAR Secretary Conrado M. Estrella III: They prepare our farmers and their organizations.

asr-000553
00:34:03.140 --> 00:34:04.880
DAR Secretary Conrado M. Estrella III: To succeed and endure.

asr-000554
00:34:04.880 --> 00:34:14.500
DAR Secretary Conrado M. Estrella III: We have learned that many agriculture-based cooperatives do not fail because of a lack of dedication or hard work.

asr-000555
00:34:15.180 --> 00:34:23.340
DAR Secretary Conrado M. Estrella III: They fail because they lack three critical foundations, financial, technical, and managerial skills.

asr-000556
00:34:23.920 --> 00:34:31.620
DAR Secretary Conrado M. Estrella III: We are equipping our beneficiaries not only to cultivate the land, but also to manage their finances responsibly,

asr-000557
00:34:31.620 --> 00:34:32.620
DAR Secretary Conrado M. Estrella III: adapt modernly,

asr-000558
00:34:33.140 --> 00:34:34.080
DAR Secretary Conrado M. Estrella III: implement technologies,

asr-000559
00:34:34.740 --> 00:34:36.700
DAR Secretary Conrado M. Estrella III: lead their cooperatives effectively,

asr-000560
00:34:37.220 --> 00:34:39.400
DAR Secretary Conrado M. Estrella III: and build sustainable enterprises.

asr-000561
00:34:40.260 --> 00:34:42.480
DAR Secretary Conrado M. Estrella III: Enthusiasm may start a cooperative,

asr-000562
00:34:43.200 --> 00:34:46.520
DAR Secretary Conrado M. Estrella III: but knowledge and good management keep it alive.

asr-000563
00:34:47.520 --> 00:34:51.440
DAR Secretary Conrado M. Estrella III: This is the kind of empowerment we want to leave behind,

asr-000564
00:34:51.440 --> 00:34:53.280
DAR Secretary Conrado M. Estrella III: not just productive farms,

asr-000565
00:34:53.840 --> 00:34:58.460
DAR Secretary Conrado M. Estrella III: but capable farmers who can sustain their progress for generations.

asr-000569
00:35:00.940 --> 00:35:07.140
DAR Secretary Conrado M. Estrella III: Access to capital is equally important in enabling our farmers to become economically independent.

asr-000570
00:35:07.140 --> 00:35:11.260
DAR Secretary Conrado M. Estrella III: From July 2022 to July 2026,

asr-000571
00:35:11.400 --> 00:35:15.880
DAR Secretary Conrado M. Estrella III: DAR has facilitated access to credit and microfinance services

asr-000572
00:35:15.880 --> 00:35:25.160
DAR Secretary Conrado M. Estrella III: for 674,282 agrarian reform beneficiaries, service count beneficiaries.

asr-000573
00:35:25.720 --> 00:35:31.940
DAR Secretary Conrado M. Estrella III: Access to affordable financing provides farmers with opportunities to invest in production,

asr-000574
00:35:31.940 --> 00:35:34.220
DAR Secretary Conrado M. Estrella III: acquire necessary inputs,

asr-000575
00:35:34.460 --> 00:35:36.180
DAR Secretary Conrado M. Estrella III: improve their enterprises,

asr-000576
00:35:36.420 --> 00:35:38.440
DAR Secretary Conrado M. Estrella III: and expand their economic activities.

asr-000577
00:35:39.040 --> 00:35:43.280
DAR Secretary Conrado M. Estrella III: Ultimately, our goal is to help build financially capable

asr-000578
00:35:43.280 --> 00:35:48.120
DAR Secretary Conrado M. Estrella III: and self-reliant farmers who can contribute more significantly

asr-000579
00:35:48.120 --> 00:35:51.980
DAR Secretary Conrado M. Estrella III: to the development of their communities and the nation.

asr-000580
00:35:53.420 --> 00:35:56.280
DAR Secretary Conrado M. Estrella III: Marketing assistance is another important component

asr-000581
00:35:56.880 --> 00:36:00.480
DAR Secretary Conrado M. Estrella III: of our support to agrarian reform beneficiaries organization.

asr-000582
00:36:01.480 --> 00:36:04.280
DAR Secretary Conrado M. Estrella III: From July 2022 to July 2026,

asr-000583
00:36:04.460 --> 00:36:14.180
DAR Secretary Conrado M. Estrella III: DAR has linked 4,934 ARB organizations to market opportunities,

asr-000584
00:36:14.720 --> 00:36:21.500
DAR Secretary Conrado M. Estrella III: benefiting 1,041,308 ARBs in terms of service count

asr-000585
00:36:21.500 --> 00:36:27.040
DAR Secretary Conrado M. Estrella III: and generating 28.98 billion in total sales.

asr-000586
00:36:27.040 --> 00:36:34.000
DAR Secretary Conrado M. Estrella III: These gains are supported through various enterprise development and market linkage,

asr-000587
00:36:34.460 --> 00:36:38.420
DAR Secretary Conrado M. Estrella III: initiatives that help ARBOS strengthen their enterprises,

asr-000588
00:36:38.420 --> 00:36:39.880
DAR Secretary Conrado M. Estrella III: develop their products,

asr-000589
00:36:39.880 --> 00:36:43.380
DAR Secretary Conrado M. Estrella III: and gain more reliable access to markets.

asr-000590
00:36:43.380 --> 00:36:49.220
DAR Secretary Conrado M. Estrella III: We also partner with institutional buyers from both the public and private sectors,

asr-000591
00:36:49.220 --> 00:36:55.140
DAR Secretary Conrado M. Estrella III: creating more direct and sustainable market opportunities for our ARBOS.

asr-000592
00:36:55.140 --> 00:36:59.540
DAR Secretary Conrado M. Estrella III: By creating these more direct market linkages,

asr-000593
00:36:59.540 --> 00:37:04.240
DAR Secretary Conrado M. Estrella III: we help reduce the exposure of our farmers to predatory pricing,

asr-000594
00:37:04.240 --> 00:37:07.460
DAR Secretary Conrado M. Estrella III: and provide them with better opportunities to negotiate

asr-000595
00:37:07.460 --> 00:37:11.100
DAR Secretary Conrado M. Estrella III: and sell their products at fairer prices.

asr-000596
00:37:12.160 --> 00:37:17.300
DAR Secretary Conrado M. Estrella III: Ultimately, our goal is to ensure that the productivity gains of our beneficiaries

asr-000597
00:37:17.300 --> 00:37:20.320
DAR Secretary Conrado M. Estrella III: are translated into actual income,

asr-000598
00:37:20.880 --> 00:37:24.860
DAR Secretary Conrado M. Estrella III: stronger enterprises, and more sustainable livelihoods.

asr-000599
00:37:25.960 --> 00:37:32.140
DAR Secretary Conrado M. Estrella III: Another important initiative is the Partnership Against Hunger and Poverty, or PAHAP, project.

asr-000600
00:37:32.140 --> 00:37:34.140
DAR Secretary Conrado M. Estrella III: The program connects agrarians,

asr-000601
00:37:34.240 --> 00:37:39.960
DAR Secretary Conrado M. Estrella III: agrarian reform beneficiary organizations directly with government and private institutions

asr-000602
00:37:39.960 --> 00:37:43.900
DAR Secretary Conrado M. Estrella III: as suppliers of nutritious agricultural products,

asr-000603
00:37:43.900 --> 00:37:51.500
DAR Secretary Conrado M. Estrella III: including rice, vegetables, and other commodities.

asr-000604
00:37:51.500 --> 00:37:56.080
DAR Secretary Conrado M. Estrella III: This creates a direct link between farmers and institutional markets,

asr-000605
00:37:56.080 --> 00:38:00.060
DAR Secretary Conrado M. Estrella III: bypassing middlemen who engage in predatory pricing,

asr-000606
00:38:00.060 --> 00:38:06.880
DAR Secretary Conrado M. Estrella III: and ensuring farmers receive a more patriotic pricing for their produce.

asr-000607
00:38:06.960 --> 00:38:12.680
DAR Secretary Conrado M. Estrella III: From July 2022 to July 2026,

asr-000608
00:38:12.680 --> 00:38:20.680
DAR Secretary Conrado M. Estrella III: the program has generated approximately 9.972 billion in total gross sales.

asr-000609
00:38:20.680 --> 00:38:25.680
DAR Secretary Conrado M. Estrella III: It has linked 448 ARBOS to institutional markets

asr-000610
00:38:25.680 --> 00:38:31.680
DAR Secretary Conrado M. Estrella III: and served 13,440 ARBs with nationwide coverage.

asr-000611
00:38:31.680 --> 00:38:35.680
DAR Secretary Conrado M. Estrella III: The project is funded through the General Appropriations Act,

asr-000612
00:38:35.680 --> 00:38:41.360
DAR Secretary Conrado M. Estrella III: with a total project fund of approximately 208 million.

asr-000613
00:38:41.360 --> 00:38:46.840
DAR Secretary Conrado M. Estrella III: This demonstrates that government support can go beyond production.

asr-000614
00:38:46.840 --> 00:38:49.640
DAR Secretary Conrado M. Estrella III: By connecting farmers directly to markets,

asr-000615
00:38:49.640 --> 00:38:52.920
DAR Secretary Conrado M. Estrella III: we create opportunities for increased income,

asr-000616
00:38:52.920 --> 00:38:59.920
DAR Secretary Conrado M. Estrella III: stronger organizations, and more sustainable agricultural enterprises.

asr-000617
00:38:59.920 --> 00:39:05.680
DAR Secretary Conrado M. Estrella III: We now proceed to the department's budget performance and proposed allocation

asr-000618
00:39:05.680 --> 00:39:09.360
DAR Secretary Conrado M. Estrella III: for fiscal year 2027.

asr-000619
00:39:09.360 --> 00:39:13.720
DAR Secretary Conrado M. Estrella III: We subscribe to the principle that government spending,

asr-000620
00:39:13.720 --> 00:39:17.360
DAR Secretary Conrado M. Estrella III: when properly and efficiently implemented,

asr-000621
00:39:17.360 --> 00:39:22.680
DAR Secretary Conrado M. Estrella III: serves as a means of pump-priming the economy,

asr-000622
00:39:22.680 --> 00:39:30.120
DAR Secretary Conrado M. Estrella III: particularly when public resources translate into quality and meaningful investments.

asr-000623
00:39:30.120 --> 00:39:35.400
DAR Secretary Conrado M. Estrella III: In DAR, our programs and projects are therefore designed not only to deliver services,

asr-000624
00:39:35.400 --> 00:39:38.800
DAR Secretary Conrado M. Estrella III: to our agrarian reform beneficiaries,

asr-000625
00:39:38.800 --> 00:39:44.080
DAR Secretary Conrado M. Estrella III: but also to generate productive economic activity in the countryside.

asr-000626
00:39:44.080 --> 00:39:50.080
DAR Secretary Conrado M. Estrella III: Through our budget, we seek to ensure that every peso entrusted to the department

asr-000627
00:39:50.080 --> 00:39:57.480
DAR Secretary Conrado M. Estrella III: is spent efficiently, responsibly, and with the highest level of accountability.

asr-000628
00:39:57.480 --> 00:40:03.000
DAR Secretary Conrado M. Estrella III: Let us now look at our Budget Utilization Rate, or BUR.

asr-000629
00:40:03.000 --> 00:40:05.080
DAR Secretary Conrado M. Estrella III: In fiscal year 2023,

asr-000630
00:40:05.400 --> 00:40:10.080
DAR Secretary Conrado M. Estrella III: against an allotment of 17.49 billion,

asr-000631
00:40:10.080 --> 00:40:18.400
DAR Secretary Conrado M. Estrella III: DAR posted an obligation rate of 74% and a disbursement rate of 82%.

asr-000632
00:40:18.400 --> 00:40:21.400
DAR Secretary Conrado M. Estrella III: In fiscal year 2024,

asr-000633
00:40:21.400 --> 00:40:26.400
DAR Secretary Conrado M. Estrella III: against an allocation of 17.385 billion,

asr-000634
00:40:26.400 --> 00:40:32.400
DAR Secretary Conrado M. Estrella III: DAR posted an obligation rate of 88.67%

asr-000635
00:40:32.400 --> 00:40:34.880
DAR Secretary Conrado M. Estrella III: and a disbursement rate of 75%.

asr-000636
00:40:34.880 --> 00:40:39.880
DAR Secretary Conrado M. Estrella III: In fiscal year 2025,

asr-000637
00:40:39.880 --> 00:40:44.880
DAR Secretary Conrado M. Estrella III: with an allotment of 20.55 billion,

asr-000638
00:40:44.880 --> 00:40:49.880
DAR Secretary Conrado M. Estrella III: our obligation rate improved to 91.49%,

asr-000639
00:40:49.880 --> 00:40:56.880
DAR Secretary Conrado M. Estrella III: while our disbursement rate increased to 74.65%.

asr-000640
00:40:56.880 --> 00:40:59.880
DAR Secretary Conrado M. Estrella III: For fiscal year 2026, as of June,

asr-000641
00:40:59.880 --> 00:41:03.560
DAR Secretary Conrado M. Estrella III: our total allotment stood at 18.379 billion.

asr-000644
00:41:05.880 --> 00:41:10.880
DAR Secretary Conrado M. Estrella III: At mid-year, we recorded an obligation rate of 47%

asr-000645
00:41:10.880 --> 00:41:14.880
DAR Secretary Conrado M. Estrella III: and a disbursement rate of 70%.

asr-000646
00:41:14.880 --> 00:41:21.880
DAR Secretary Conrado M. Estrella III: This reflects that activities and services benefiting our agrarian reform beneficiaries

asr-000647
00:41:21.880 --> 00:41:23.880
DAR Secretary Conrado M. Estrella III: have been timely delivered.

asr-000648
00:41:23.880 --> 00:41:28.880
DAR Secretary Conrado M. Estrella III: These figures tell us two things.

asr-000649
00:41:28.880 --> 00:41:29.880
DAR Secretary Conrado M. Estrella III: First, the department has demonstrated that it can absorb and use the resources of the government.

asr-000652
00:41:36.880 --> 00:41:42.880
DAR Secretary Conrado M. Estrella III: Second, there remains room to further strengthen the pace of implementation,

asr-000653
00:41:42.880 --> 00:41:51.880
DAR Secretary Conrado M. Estrella III: particularly in translating allotments into obligations and obligations into actual disbursements.

asr-000654
00:41:51.880 --> 00:41:56.880
DAR Secretary Conrado M. Estrella III: As of mid-year, our obligation rate stands at 47%,

asr-000655
00:41:56.880 --> 00:41:58.880
DAR Secretary Conrado M. Estrella III: while our disbursement rate is already at 70%.

asr-000659
00:42:01.880 --> 00:42:07.880
DAR Secretary Conrado M. Estrella III: While we recognize the need to accelerate our disbursement rate,

asr-000660
00:42:07.880 --> 00:42:11.880
DAR Secretary Conrado M. Estrella III: it is positive indication that our existing obligations

asr-000661
00:42:11.880 --> 00:42:16.880
DAR Secretary Conrado M. Estrella III: are being translated into actual payments and program delivery.

asr-000662
00:42:16.880 --> 00:42:20.880
DAR Secretary Conrado M. Estrella III: For the remaining months of fiscal year 2026,

asr-000663
00:42:20.880 --> 00:42:23.880
DAR Secretary Conrado M. Estrella III: our task is clear—

asr-000664
00:42:23.880 --> 00:42:30.880
DAR Secretary Conrado M. Estrella III: accelerate implementation without sacrificing accountability and compliance.

asr-000665
00:42:30.880 --> 00:42:33.420
DAR Secretary Conrado M. Estrella III: is not spending for the sake of spending.

asr-000666
00:42:33.420 --> 00:42:38.860
DAR Secretary Conrado M. Estrella III: Our goal is responsible and judicious utilization

asr-000667
00:42:38.860 --> 00:42:43.140
DAR Secretary Conrado M. Estrella III: where every obligation represents a real commitment

asr-000668
00:42:43.140 --> 00:42:47.560
DAR Secretary Conrado M. Estrella III: and every disbursement represents an actual accomplishment

asr-000669
00:42:47.560 --> 00:42:50.100
DAR Secretary Conrado M. Estrella III: delivered to our beneficiaries.

asr-000670
00:42:51.860 --> 00:42:54.120
DAR Secretary Conrado M. Estrella III: Against this performance backdrop,

asr-000671
00:42:54.860 --> 00:42:59.560
DAR Secretary Conrado M. Estrella III: we now move to our proposed budget for fiscal year 2027.

asr-000672
00:42:59.560 --> 00:43:06.020
DAR Secretary Conrado M. Estrella III: The Department of Agrarian Reform has a total fiscal year 2027

asr-000673
00:43:06.020 --> 00:43:12.240
DAR Secretary Conrado M. Estrella III: national expenditure program of approximately 16.935 billion.

asr-000674
00:43:13.280 --> 00:43:20.620
DAR Secretary Conrado M. Estrella III: This represents the resources that will support

asr-000675
00:43:20.620 --> 00:43:25.200
DAR Secretary Conrado M. Estrella III: the Department's continuing implementation of agrarian reform

asr-000676
00:43:25.200 --> 00:43:29.800
DAR Secretary Conrado M. Estrella III: from securing land tenure and delivering agrarian justice

asr-000677
00:43:29.800 --> 00:43:31.400
DAR Secretary Conrado M. Estrella III: to providing support services to the people.

asr-000678
00:43:31.420 --> 00:43:33.420
DAR Secretary Conrado M. Estrella III: and implementing projects.

asr-000679
00:43:34.900 --> 00:43:41.380
DAR Secretary Conrado M. Estrella III: But this amount must again be viewed in terms of what we intend to accomplish with it.

asr-000680
00:43:42.100 --> 00:43:45.360
DAR Secretary Conrado M. Estrella III: What we in DAR continuously ask is,

asr-000681
00:43:46.320 --> 00:43:50.160
DAR Secretary Conrado M. Estrella III: how do we ensure that this 16.935 billion

asr-000682
00:43:50.160 --> 00:43:56.900
DAR Secretary Conrado M. Estrella III: produces the greatest possible value for our agrarian reform beneficiaries?

asr-000683
00:43:56.900 --> 00:44:00.700
DAR Secretary Conrado M. Estrella III: That requires sound planning,

asr-000684
00:44:01.420 --> 00:44:03.420
DAR Secretary Conrado M. Estrella III: disciplined financial management,

asr-000685
00:44:03.420 --> 00:44:05.420
DAR Secretary Conrado M. Estrella III: timely procurement,

asr-000686
00:44:05.420 --> 00:44:07.420
DAR Secretary Conrado M. Estrella III: reliable information systems

asr-000687
00:44:07.420 --> 00:44:12.220
DAR Secretary Conrado M. Estrella III: and strong accountability at every level of the Department,

asr-000688
00:44:12.220 --> 00:44:16.140
DAR Secretary Conrado M. Estrella III: and of course the support of our distinguished lawmakers.

asr-000689
00:44:16.140 --> 00:44:21.380
DAR Secretary Conrado M. Estrella III: Thank you in advance for your support.

asr-000690
00:44:21.380 --> 00:44:34.350
DAR Secretary Conrado M. Estrella III: Let us now break down the 16.935 billion fiscal year 2027.

asr-000691
00:44:34.350 --> 00:44:36.350
DAR Secretary Conrado M. Estrella III: Next.

asr-000692
00:44:36.830 --> 00:44:49.350
DAR Secretary Conrado M. Estrella III: According to expense class, approximately 7.066 billion or 41.72% is allocated for personal services.

asr-000693
00:44:50.310 --> 00:44:59.550
DAR Secretary Conrado M. Estrella III: Another 8.61 billion or 50.90% is allocated for maintenance and other operating expenses.

asr-000694
00:45:00.000 --> 00:45:08.700
DAR Secretary Conrado M. Estrella III: While 1.249 billion or 7.37% is allocated for capital outlays.

asr-000695
00:45:08.960 --> 00:45:18.020
DAR Secretary Conrado M. Estrella III: So, makikita po natin dito, mas maliit po ang kapital, mas malaki ang kita kung iahambing natin sa isang negosyo.

asr-000696
00:45:18.880 --> 00:45:22.680
DAR Secretary Conrado M. Estrella III: Hindi po shortchains ang ating government dito.

asr-000697
00:45:22.680 --> 00:45:32.680
DAR Secretary Conrado M. Estrella III: The largest share goes to MOOE which supports the actual implementation and day-to-day delivery of the department's programs and activities.

asr-000698
00:45:33.900 --> 00:45:46.820
DAR Secretary Conrado M. Estrella III: Personal services, meanwhile, provides the human resources necessary to carry out our mandate from the central office down to our regional, provincial, and municipal offices.

asr-000699
00:45:46.820 --> 00:45:52.660
DAR Secretary Conrado M. Estrella III: Capital outlays support necessary investments that strengthen the department's operations.

asr-000700
00:45:52.680 --> 00:45:59.180
DAR Secretary Conrado M. Estrella III: What is important is that these components work together.

asr-000701
00:46:00.140 --> 00:46:10.020
DAR Secretary Conrado M. Estrella III: We need people, we need operational resources, and we need the systems, equipment, and facilities that allow our people to work effectively.

asr-000702
00:46:10.020 --> 00:46:22.660
DAR Secretary Conrado M. Estrella III: Our responsibility is to ensure that this mix of resources remains aligned with the department's priorities and delivers the maximum benefit to our state.

asr-000703
00:46:22.680 --> 00:46:30.220
DAR Secretary Conrado M. Estrella III: As we look toward fiscal year 2027, our direction remains clear.

asr-000704
00:46:32.000 --> 00:46:52.020
DAR Secretary Conrado M. Estrella III: Sustain the gains we have achieved, complete our remaining debt condonation obligations, continue land distribution and strengthen tenure security, expand access to agrarian justice, and ensure that our beneficiaries have the means to make their land productive and sustainable.

asr-000705
00:46:52.680 --> 00:47:12.260
DAR Secretary Conrado M. Estrella III: For land tenure security, DAR will sustain the upward trajectory of distribution of split e-titles and remaining land titles, including CLOAS, and continue the implementation of Executive Order No. 75 Series of 2019.

asr-000706
00:47:12.260 --> 00:47:22.260
DAR Secretary Conrado M. Estrella III: We will also complete the distribution of the remaining certificates of condonation with the release of mortgage in the Bangsa-Moro Autonomous Region.

asr-000707
00:47:23.280 --> 00:47:36.020
DAR Secretary Conrado M. Estrella III: At the same time, we will strengthen engagement with stakeholders to accelerate the resolution of issues affecting the documentation of remaining land holdings.

asr-000708
00:47:36.800 --> 00:47:48.860
DAR Secretary Conrado M. Estrella III: Finally, the department will establish a more accurate and reliable inventory and data system through comprehensive digitalization of land distribution and tenure security records.

asr-000709
00:47:48.920 --> 00:47:51.860
DAR Secretary Conrado M. Estrella III: These measures are essential to ensuring that land distribution

asr-000710
00:47:52.680 --> 00:48:00.480
DAR Secretary Conrado M. Estrella III: is not only accelerated but properly documented, transparent, and sustainable.

asr-000711
00:48:01.440 --> 00:48:07.440
DAR Secretary Conrado M. Estrella III: For agrarian justice delivery, the Department will continue to streamline legal processes

asr-000712
00:48:07.440 --> 00:48:10.500
DAR Secretary Conrado M. Estrella III: and reduce delays in case resolution.

asr-000713
00:48:11.400 --> 00:48:18.520
DAR Secretary Conrado M. Estrella III: The implementation of the Electronic Certificate of No Pending Appeal or e-CONA system

asr-000714
00:48:18.520 --> 00:48:24.620
DAR Secretary Conrado M. Estrella III: will help address delays in the issuance of Certificates of No Pending Appeal

asr-000715
00:48:24.620 --> 00:48:29.080
DAR Secretary Conrado M. Estrella III: and facilitate the resolution and termination of cases.

asr-000716
00:48:29.920 --> 00:48:36.520
DAR Secretary Conrado M. Estrella III: DAR will also strengthen the training and institutionalization of alternative dispute resolution methods

asr-000717
00:48:37.080 --> 00:48:44.680
DAR Secretary Conrado M. Estrella III: among its legal personnel with the objective of achieving mutually acceptable outcomes among parties.

asr-000718
00:48:44.680 --> 00:48:47.740
DAR Secretary Conrado M. Estrella III: Consistent with DAR Memorandum 198,

asr-000719
00:48:47.740 --> 00:48:58.940
DAR Secretary Conrado M. Estrella III: our field implementors will be encouraged to maximize the use of agrarian reform justice on wills or ARJAL,

asr-000720
00:48:59.260 --> 00:49:06.100
DAR Secretary Conrado M. Estrella III: bringing free, adequate, and effective legal assistance closer to our farmer beneficiaries,

asr-000721
00:49:07.080 --> 00:49:11.880
DAR Secretary Conrado M. Estrella III: agricultural lessees, landowners, and other stakeholders.

asr-000722
00:49:11.880 --> 00:49:17.560
DAR Secretary Conrado M. Estrella III: This is particularly important for farmers who may otherwise have to leave their areas

asr-000723
00:49:17.560 --> 00:49:21.900
DAR Secretary Conrado M. Estrella III: simply to access legal assistance.

asr-000724
00:49:21.900 --> 00:49:31.540
DAR Secretary Conrado M. Estrella III: The Department will also strengthen its legal workforce to help draft and fast-track the resolution of agrarian law implementation cases,

asr-000725
00:49:32.020 --> 00:49:35.840
DAR Secretary Conrado M. Estrella III: consistent with our zero-caseload policy.

asr-000726
00:49:36.320 --> 00:49:46.540
DAR Secretary Conrado M. Estrella III: Our objective is straightforward, timely, accessible, and fair justice for our agrarian reform stakeholders.

asr-000727
00:49:46.540 --> 00:49:56.640
DAR Secretary Conrado M. Estrella III: Ladies and gentlemen, we subscribe to the dictum that justice delayed is justice denied.

asr-000728
00:49:57.160 --> 00:50:10.140
DAR Secretary Conrado M. Estrella III: That's why we are full speed ahead of the resolution of the pending cases.

asr-000729
00:50:11.560 --> 00:50:16.140
DAR Secretary Conrado M. Estrella III: Finally, under agrarian reform beneficiaries development and sustainability,

asr-000730
00:50:16.540 --> 00:50:25.780
DAR Secretary Conrado M. Estrella III: the Department will continue transforming agrarian reform beneficiary organizations into self-sustaining cooperatives.

asr-000731
00:50:26.780 --> 00:50:29.920
DAR Secretary Conrado M. Estrella III: This will be supported through several key interventions.

asr-000732
00:50:30.700 --> 00:50:39.960
DAR Secretary Conrado M. Estrella III: First, we will strengthen access to capital so that organizations have the financial capacity to expand their enterprises.

asr-000733
00:50:39.960 --> 00:50:46.520
DAR Secretary Conrado M. Estrella III: Second, we will promote secure market integration through public-private partnerships.

asr-000734
00:50:46.540 --> 00:51:03.060
DAR Secretary Conrado M. Estrella III: Third, we will encourage technological adoption to improve productivity and competitiveness.

asr-000735
00:51:03.060 --> 00:51:07.840
DAR Secretary Conrado M. Estrella III: And fourth, we will strengthen institutional capacity building,

asr-000736
00:51:08.400 --> 00:51:17.060
DAR Secretary Conrado M. Estrella III: ensuring that ARB organizations are equipped with the leadership, management, and organizational capabilities

asr-000737
00:51:17.060 --> 00:51:20.980
DAR Secretary Conrado M. Estrella III: necessary to sustain their operations.

asr-000738
00:51:20.980 --> 00:51:27.440
DAR Secretary Conrado M. Estrella III: The objective is to move our beneficiaries beyond dependence on government assistance

asr-000739
00:51:27.440 --> 00:51:32.360
DAR Secretary Conrado M. Estrella III: toward greater self-reliance, productivity, and sustainability.

asr-000740
00:51:33.280 --> 00:51:39.340
DAR Secretary Conrado M. Estrella III: Honorable members of Congress, distinguished guests, ladies and gentlemen,

asr-000741
00:51:39.340 --> 00:51:46.420
DAR Secretary Conrado M. Estrella III: the fiscal year 2027 proposed budget of the Department of Agrarian Reform

asr-000743
00:51:47.060 --> 00:51:51.340
DAR Secretary Conrado M. Estrella III: It is ultimately about more than figures and appropriations.

asr-000744
00:51:51.340 --> 00:51:59.220
DAR Secretary Conrado M. Estrella III: It is about fulfilling our commitments, securing the land and rights of our farmers,

asr-000745
00:52:00.060 --> 00:52:07.680
DAR Secretary Conrado M. Estrella III: and completing the historic debt condonation program mandated by Republic Act 11953

asr-000746
00:52:07.680 --> 00:52:11.940
DAR Secretary Conrado M. Estrella III: and directed by President Ferdinand R. Marcos, Jr.

asr-000747
00:52:12.520 --> 00:52:15.320
DAR Secretary Conrado M. Estrella III: With the resources entrusted to us,

asr-000749
00:52:18.800 --> 00:52:24.700
DAR Secretary Conrado M. Estrella III: We are committed to ensuring that every peso is translated into meaningful programs,

asr-000750
00:52:25.420 --> 00:52:32.540
DAR Secretary Conrado M. Estrella III: concrete services, and tangible benefits for our farmers and their families.

asr-000751
00:52:33.080 --> 00:52:38.580
DAR Secretary Conrado M. Estrella III: As we move forward, we remain guided by one enduring vision,

asr-000752
00:52:39.360 --> 00:52:43.600
DAR Secretary Conrado M. Estrella III: sariling lupa para sa bagong bukas na masagana.

asr-000753
00:52:44.140 --> 00:52:47.380
DAR Secretary Conrado M. Estrella III: Thank you for your patience. Maraming salamat po.

asr-000754
00:52:54.880 --> 00:52:58.960
Rep. Ian Paul L. Dy: Maraming maraming salamat, Secretary Conrad Estrella,

asr-000755
00:52:59.400 --> 00:53:06.360
Rep. Ian Paul L. Dy: for that detailed and comprehensive report on the agrarian reform.

asr-000756
00:53:06.360 --> 00:53:10.260
Rep. Ian Paul L. Dy: May we now move on to interpolations and discussion.

asr-000757
00:53:11.480 --> 00:53:18.360
Rep. Ian Paul L. Dy: May I remind our distinguished colleagues that each member is allotted five minutes for questions or interpolation,

asr-000758
00:53:19.740 --> 00:53:22.420
Rep. Ian Paul L. Dy: excluding the responses of the resource persons.

asr-000759
00:53:23.060 --> 00:53:24.120
Rep. Ian Paul L. Dy: When the bell sounds,

asr-000760
00:53:24.120 --> 00:53:26.580
Rep. Ian Paul L. Dy: the member has 30 seconds to conclude.

asr-000761
00:53:27.640 --> 00:53:30.440
Rep. Ian Paul L. Dy: Consistent with the long-standing practice of the House,

asr-000762
00:53:31.340 --> 00:53:40.180
Rep. Ian Paul L. Dy: the Chair shall recognize minority, independent, and majority members in an alternating manner when practicable.

asr-000763
00:53:40.900 --> 00:53:47.620
Rep. Ian Paul L. Dy: The Chair first recognizes the Honorable Representative Leila de Lima from the minority.

asr-000764
00:53:48.060 --> 00:53:48.340
Rep. Ian Paul L. Dy: Ma'am?

asr-000765
00:53:49.340 --> 00:53:50.960
Rep. Leila M. de Lima: Thank you very much, Mr. Chair.

asr-000766
00:53:52.020 --> 00:53:52.780
Rep. Leila M. de Lima: Good afternoon.

asr-000767
00:53:52.780 --> 00:53:52.980
Rep. Leila M. de Lima: Good afternoon.

asr-000768
00:53:52.980 --> 00:53:53.860
Rep. Leila M. de Lima: Good afternoon.

asr-000769
00:53:54.120 --> 00:53:59.120
Rep. Leila M. de Lima: Good afternoon to my colleagues and good afternoon to the DAR family, especially to the Secretary.

asr-000770
00:53:59.620 --> 00:54:06.760
Rep. Leila M. de Lima: First, I wish to manifest for the record that I am fully supportive of the proposed budget for the DAR.

asr-000771
00:54:07.160 --> 00:54:13.080
Rep. Leila M. de Lima: But I have, of course, issues to—I have questions to propound on certain issues.

asr-000772
00:54:13.200 --> 00:54:14.680
Rep. Leila M. de Lima: I'm aware of the limited time.

asr-000773
00:54:14.740 --> 00:54:21.000
Rep. Leila M. de Lima: I have only five minutes, so tingnan ko na lang po kung ilan ang makukover ng five minutes.

asr-000774
00:54:21.000 --> 00:54:23.000
Rep. Leila M. de Lima: So, diretsuhan lang po tayo.

asr-000775
00:54:24.120 --> 00:54:25.600
Rep. Leila M. de Lima: The split project.

asr-000776
00:54:26.360 --> 00:54:28.020
Rep. Leila M. de Lima: Ano na po pinaka-status ng split?

asr-000777
00:54:28.300 --> 00:54:29.140
Rep. Leila M. de Lima: Is it finished?

asr-000778
00:54:29.320 --> 00:54:31.820
Rep. Leila M. de Lima: Is the World Bank loan exhausted?

asr-000779
00:54:32.440 --> 00:54:37.040
Rep. Leila M. de Lima: Or did the department simply deprioritize the split?

asr-000780
00:54:37.040 --> 00:54:45.040
Rep. Leila M. de Lima: The split is, of course, the support for parcelization for individual titling.

asr-000781
00:54:46.460 --> 00:54:50.740
Rep. Leila M. de Lima: So, priority pa rin ho ba yung split project?

asr-000782
00:54:51.420 --> 00:54:53.960
Rep. Leila M. de Lima: Is it still a DAR priority for 2027?

asr-000783
00:54:54.120 --> 00:54:58.140
DAR Secretary Conrado M. Estrella III: Yes, Your Honor.

asr-000784
00:54:58.440 --> 00:54:59.980
DAR Secretary Conrado M. Estrella III: It is still a priority.

asr-000785
00:55:00.820 --> 00:55:06.000
DAR Secretary Conrado M. Estrella III: In fact, we are moving full speed ahead with the split program.

asr-000786
00:55:06.000 --> 00:55:16.720
DAR Secretary Conrado M. Estrella III: And we are proud to say, Your Honor, that no less than the World Bank, because this is a World Bank-funded project,

asr-000787
00:55:17.540 --> 00:55:24.000
DAR Secretary Conrado M. Estrella III: no less than the World Bank have announced that one of the—

asr-000788
00:55:24.120 --> 00:55:28.140
DAR Secretary Conrado M. Estrella III: best, or if not the best-performing agencies,

asr-000789
00:55:29.040 --> 00:55:37.140
DAR Secretary Conrado M. Estrella III: one of the best, or if not the best agencies that are implementing World Bank-funded projects

asr-000790
00:55:37.140 --> 00:55:39.100
DAR Secretary Conrado M. Estrella III: is the Department of Agrarian Reform.

asr-000791
00:55:39.740 --> 00:55:46.300
DAR Secretary Conrado M. Estrella III: And we really have to concentrate on this, Your Honor, especially this year,

asr-000792
00:55:46.900 --> 00:55:50.320
DAR Secretary Conrado M. Estrella III: because this is going to expire next year.

asr-000793
00:55:50.320 --> 00:55:53.320
Rep. Leila M. de Lima: December 31st, 2027.

asr-000794
00:55:54.120 --> 00:56:07.400
DAR Secretary Conrado M. Estrella III: And we really need this, Your Honor, because this helps us in the parcelization of the collective cloas that were distributed in the past.

asr-000795
00:56:07.940 --> 00:56:16.300
DAR Secretary Conrado M. Estrella III: And this collective cloas, as we all know, did not really accelerate the distribution of titles.

asr-000796
00:56:16.300 --> 00:56:23.700
DAR Secretary Conrado M. Estrella III: Rather, it created the confusion and even conflict among the agrarian reform beneficiaries.

asr-000797
00:56:24.120 --> 00:56:34.400
DAR Secretary Conrado M. Estrella III: Because, Your Honor, well, in the collective cloas, there was no parcelization to speak of.

asr-000798
00:56:34.400 --> 00:56:38.360
DAR Secretary Conrado M. Estrella III: It was not specified in the title.

asr-000799
00:56:38.820 --> 00:56:43.400
DAR Secretary Conrado M. Estrella III: One title bearing numerous owners, but they don't know which part—

asr-000800
00:56:43.400 --> 00:56:44.700
Rep. Leila M. de Lima: So, doon nagkakaroon ng problema?

asr-000801
00:56:45.060 --> 00:56:46.720
DAR Secretary Conrado M. Estrella III: Doon nagkakaroon ng problema.

asr-000802
00:56:47.580 --> 00:56:53.400
DAR Secretary Conrado M. Estrella III: And that is why the split came about so that we can already start—

asr-000803
00:56:54.120 --> 00:56:55.500
DAR Secretary Conrado M. Estrella III: the parcelization.

asr-000804
00:56:56.200 --> 00:56:58.540
DAR Secretary Conrado M. Estrella III: And we have been successful so far, Your Honor.

asr-000805
00:56:58.620 --> 00:57:00.960
Rep. Leila M. de Lima: So, the World Bank loan has not been exhausted yet?

asr-000806
00:57:01.360 --> 00:57:03.640
DAR Secretary Conrado M. Estrella III: No, it has not been exhausted.

asr-000807
00:57:03.640 --> 00:57:12.300
DAR Secretary Conrado M. Estrella III: They are very strict with the approval of the releases, Your Honor.

asr-000808
00:57:13.320 --> 00:57:17.720
Rep. Leila M. de Lima: So, gusto ko po sana makakuha ng data for 2025 and 2026.

asr-000809
00:57:18.380 --> 00:57:21.640
Rep. Leila M. de Lima: How many collective cloas were validated, parcels were surveyed,

asr-000810
00:57:22.820 --> 00:57:24.100
Rep. Leila M. de Lima: and e-titles were generated?

asr-000811
00:57:24.120 --> 00:57:30.420
Rep. Leila M. de Lima: And actually distributed compared with DAR's annual targets?

asr-000812
00:57:30.880 --> 00:57:32.760
Rep. Leila M. de Lima: Can DAR provide the figures per region?

asr-000813
00:57:33.520 --> 00:57:39.880
Rep. Leila M. de Lima: You don't have to produce it now, but if you have it now, I'd be happy to have that.

asr-000814
00:57:40.320 --> 00:57:44.960
Rep. Leila M. de Lima: How much of the split loan has also been disbursed to date?

asr-000815
00:57:45.380 --> 00:57:50.920
Rep. Leila M. de Lima: Kasi nga yung limited time left for you to complete the program or the project.

asr-000816
00:57:50.920 --> 00:57:53.880
Rep. Leila M. de Lima: Doon naman po tayo sa LTSB budget.

asr-000817
00:57:54.120 --> 00:58:00.160
Rep. Leila M. de Lima: Based on 2027 NEP, may budget allocation po ang DAR ng 4.10 billion

asr-000818
00:58:00.160 --> 00:58:05.040
Rep. Leila M. de Lima: para sa Land Tenure Security Program or yung LTSB.

asr-000819
00:58:05.500 --> 00:58:09.100
Rep. Leila M. de Lima: Pero may libu-libong ARBs pa rin po na owners on paper.

asr-000820
00:58:09.720 --> 00:58:13.540
Rep. Leila M. de Lima: Dahil hindi nila actual na napapasok, nahahawakan,

asr-000821
00:58:14.260 --> 00:58:18.480
Rep. Leila M. de Lima: o na lilinang ang mga lupang iginawad sa kanila.

asr-000822
00:58:18.780 --> 00:58:22.800
Rep. Leila M. de Lima: Magkano po sa 4.10 billion pesos allocation

asr-000823
00:58:22.800 --> 00:58:23.480
Rep. Leila M. de Lima: ang direktang—

asr-000824
00:58:24.120 --> 00:58:27.200
Rep. Leila M. de Lima: ilalaan para tugunan ng mga backlog

asr-000825
00:58:27.200 --> 00:58:32.660
Rep. Leila M. de Lima: sa installation, land acquisition, compensation, at enforcement.

asr-000826
00:58:33.920 --> 00:58:35.880
Rep. Leila M. de Lima: At ilang hectares po, at higit sa lahat,

asr-000827
00:58:36.020 --> 00:58:39.200
Rep. Leila M. de Lima: ilang hectares at ilang ARBs po

asr-000828
00:58:39.200 --> 00:58:41.960
Rep. Leila M. de Lima: ang konkretong commitment ng DAR

asr-000829
00:58:41.960 --> 00:58:45.440
Rep. Leila M. de Lima: na mailalagay sa actual na posesyon,

asr-000830
00:58:46.160 --> 00:58:48.560
Rep. Leila M. de Lima: sa posesyon at control ng mga beneficiaries

asr-000831
00:58:48.560 --> 00:58:50.240
Rep. Leila M. de Lima: sa ilalim ng programang ito.

asr-000832
00:58:51.440 --> 00:58:52.280
DAR Secretary Conrado M. Estrella III: Your Honor,

asr-000833
00:58:52.280 --> 00:58:55.080
DAR Secretary Conrado M. Estrella III: if you will allow it,

asr-000834
00:58:55.340 --> 00:58:59.580
DAR Secretary Conrado M. Estrella III: our Undersecretary for FOO will answer that concern.

asr-000835
00:58:59.880 --> 00:59:01.000
Rep. Ian Paul L. Dy: Yes, please.

asr-000835-split-2
00:59:01.000 --> 00:59:01.520
DAR Secretary Conrado M. Estrella III: Thank you.

asr-000836
00:59:01.540 --> 00:59:05.660
DAR Secretary Conrado M. Estrella III: May I request that from the Chair

asr-000837
00:59:05.660 --> 00:59:11.540
DAR Secretary Conrado M. Estrella III: that Undersecretary Keisel Celeste be recognized.

asr-000838
00:59:12.460 --> 00:59:13.400
DAR Undersecretary for Field Operations Atty. Kazel C. Celeste: Thank you, Your Honor.

asr-000839
00:59:13.760 --> 00:59:16.600
Rep. Ian Paul L. Dy: Ay, Yusek Keisel Celeste, you're recognized.

asr-000840
00:59:17.120 --> 00:59:18.120
DAR Undersecretary for Field Operations Atty. Kazel C. Celeste: Thank you, Your Honor.

asr-000841
00:59:18.120 --> 00:59:22.160
DAR Undersecretary for Field Operations Atty. Kazel C. Celeste: Mr. Chair, based on the budgetary ceiling provided,

asr-000842
00:59:22.280 --> 00:59:23.280
DAR Undersecretary for Field Operations Atty. Kazel C. Celeste: for by the DBM,

asr-000843
00:59:23.880 --> 00:59:26.440
DAR Undersecretary for Field Operations Atty. Kazel C. Celeste: tayo po ay binigyan lang po tayo

asr-000844
00:59:26.440 --> 00:59:32.180
DAR Undersecretary for Field Operations Atty. Kazel C. Celeste: ng about 20,000 hectares to be funded each year.

asr-000845
00:59:32.320 --> 00:59:35.080
DAR Undersecretary for Field Operations Atty. Kazel C. Celeste: So based on this 20,000 hectares funded each year,

asr-000846
00:59:35.460 --> 00:59:38.020
DAR Undersecretary for Field Operations Atty. Kazel C. Celeste: nagbibigay po tayo ng about, let's say,

asr-000847
00:59:38.120 --> 00:59:41.300
DAR Undersecretary for Field Operations Atty. Kazel C. Celeste: rough figure po, nasa 10,000 pesos per hectare

asr-000848
00:59:41.300 --> 00:59:45.360
DAR Undersecretary for Field Operations Atty. Kazel C. Celeste: ang funded po natin for LTSP

asr-000849
00:59:45.360 --> 00:59:48.680
DAR Undersecretary for Field Operations Atty. Kazel C. Celeste: from documentation down to distribution, Mr. Chair.

asr-000850
00:59:48.680 --> 00:59:51.080
Rep. Leila M. de Lima: 10,000 per hectare. Is that sufficient?

asr-000851
00:59:52.280 --> 00:59:52.820
DAR Undersecretary for Field Operations Atty. Kazel C. Celeste: No, ma'am.

asr-000852
00:59:53.080 --> 00:59:53.520
Rep. Leila M. de Lima: Absolutely.

asr-000853
00:59:53.960 --> 00:59:54.860
DAR Undersecretary for Field Operations Atty. Kazel C. Celeste: No, ma'am.

asr-000854
00:59:54.920 --> 01:00:00.000
Rep. Leila M. de Lima: Okay. Pero yung proposal nyo, was it the one granted now sa NEP?

asr-000855
01:00:00.000 --> 01:00:02.180
Rep. Leila M. de Lima: Is that the same as your proposed amount?

asr-000856
01:00:02.580 --> 01:00:06.980
DAR Undersecretary for Field Operations Atty. Kazel C. Celeste: No, ma'am. We could propose definitely a higher target,

asr-000857
01:00:07.200 --> 01:00:10.140
DAR Undersecretary for Field Operations Atty. Kazel C. Celeste: but based on the budgetary ceiling provided for by the DVM,

asr-000858
01:00:10.140 --> 01:00:16.400
DAR Undersecretary for Field Operations Atty. Kazel C. Celeste: we are constrained to have it budgeted up until only about 20,000 hectares per year.

asr-000859
01:00:16.420 --> 01:00:18.220
Rep. Leila M. de Lima: And that would cover how many hectares again?

asr-000860
01:00:19.500 --> 01:00:22.240
DAR Undersecretary for Field Operations Atty. Kazel C. Celeste: About 20,000 to 22,000. One is to one, ma'am.

asr-000861
01:00:22.880 --> 01:00:25.100
Rep. Leila M. de Lima: Pwede na siguro yun for 2027?

asr-000862
01:00:26.180 --> 01:00:27.300
DAR Undersecretary for Field Operations Atty. Kazel C. Celeste: Not enough, ma'am.

asr-000863
01:00:27.420 --> 01:00:28.460
DAR Undersecretary for Field Operations Atty. Kazel C. Celeste: Not enough, definitely.

asr-000864
01:00:28.460 --> 01:00:30.460
Rep. Leila M. de Lima: Doon naman po tayo sa debt condonation.

asr-000865
01:00:31.240 --> 01:00:37.160
Rep. Leila M. de Lima: Nag-report po ang DAR na 57.6 billion of farmers' obligations ang nakondone.

asr-000866
01:00:37.260 --> 01:00:38.080
Rep. Leila M. de Lima: Can you confirm it?

asr-000867
01:00:39.100 --> 01:00:41.620
DAR Undersecretary for Field Operations Atty. Kazel C. Celeste: 57.76 billion.

asr-000868
01:00:42.060 --> 01:00:42.480
DAR Undersecretary for Field Operations Atty. Kazel C. Celeste: Yes, Your Honor.

asr-000869
01:00:42.500 --> 01:00:47.460
Rep. Leila M. de Lima: Kinabang umano ang mahigit 610,000 ARBs.

asr-000870
01:00:48.140 --> 01:00:48.720
DAR Undersecretary for Field Operations Atty. Kazel C. Celeste: Yes, Your Honor.

asr-000871
01:00:49.520 --> 01:00:54.460
Rep. Leila M. de Lima: Ilang ARBs na po ang actual na nakatanggap ng debt condonation hanggang sa kasalukuyan?

asr-000872
01:00:54.460 --> 01:00:54.960
Rep. Leila M. de Lima: Nandito.

asr-000873
01:00:55.620 --> 01:00:58.460
Rep. Leila M. de Lima: At ilang porsyento po ito ng kabuang bilang ng ELP?

asr-000874
01:00:58.460 --> 01:01:00.240
Rep. Leila M. de Lima: Eligible beneficiaries.

asr-000875
01:01:03.650 --> 01:01:05.830
DAR Secretary Conrado M. Estrella III: She would like to answer it, Your Honor.

asr-000876
01:01:06.250 --> 01:01:07.190
DAR Secretary Conrado M. Estrella III: Go ahead, please.

asr-000877
01:01:08.050 --> 01:01:16.050
DAR Undersecretary for Field Operations Atty. Kazel C. Celeste: Your Honor, as of date, we have already distributed about 703,000 COCROMs to our ARBs.

asr-000878
01:01:16.050 --> 01:01:25.430
Rep. Leila M. de Lima: It was also reported that may ilang mga ARBs po ang hindi qualified para sa debt condonation.

asr-000879
01:01:25.630 --> 01:01:30.210
Rep. Leila M. de Lima: At sa halip ay isinailalim na lang ng moratorium.

asr-000880
01:01:30.830 --> 01:01:34.930
Rep. Leila M. de Lima: Ilang ARBs po ang hindi naisama sa condonation program?

asr-000881
01:01:35.410 --> 01:01:39.010
Rep. Leila M. de Lima: At ano-ano po yung mga dahilan kung bakit hindi sila kasama?

asr-000882
01:01:39.210 --> 01:01:41.550
Rep. Leila M. de Lima: What are the reasons for their exclusion?

asr-000883
01:01:42.430 --> 01:01:46.590
Rep. Leila M. de Lima: At magkano po ang kabuang halaga ng utang na nanatili nilang kailangang bayaran?

asr-000884
01:01:47.210 --> 01:01:50.170
DAR Undersecretary for Field Operations Atty. Kazel C. Celeste: Your Honor, based on the data that we have right now,

asr-000885
01:01:50.250 --> 01:01:56.150
DAR Undersecretary for Field Operations Atty. Kazel C. Celeste: the only COCROMs that we have not yet distributed are the ones that have been,

asr-000886
01:01:56.610 --> 01:01:59.510
DAR Undersecretary for Field Operations Atty. Kazel C. Celeste: that are supposed to be distributed in the BARMM area.

asr-000887
01:01:59.510 --> 01:02:00.350
DAR Undersecretary for Field Operations Atty. Kazel C. Celeste: But based on...

asr-000888
01:02:00.830 --> 01:02:01.970
DAR Undersecretary for Field Operations Atty. Kazel C. Celeste: Your question po.

asr-000889
01:02:02.410 --> 01:02:12.250
DAR Undersecretary for Field Operations Atty. Kazel C. Celeste: We will definitely validate this issue on where some of our ARBs have not allegedly been issued cockrobs.

asr-000890
01:02:12.250 --> 01:02:13.970
Rep. Leila M. de Lima: The reasons for the exclusion.

asr-000891
01:02:14.950 --> 01:02:18.550
Rep. Leila M. de Lima: I suppose you have ideas why they have been excluded.

asr-000892
01:02:19.010 --> 01:02:20.010
Rep. Leila M. de Lima: Ano po ba yung mga usual?

asr-000893
01:02:27.060 --> 01:02:32.200
DAR Undersecretary for Field Operations Atty. Kazel C. Celeste: One of the reasons why these ARBs may have been excluded, Your Honor,

asr-000894
01:02:32.440 --> 01:02:36.260
DAR Undersecretary for Field Operations Atty. Kazel C. Celeste: is that the implementation of RA 11953.

asr-000895
01:02:36.840 --> 01:02:45.580
DAR Undersecretary for Field Operations Atty. Kazel C. Celeste: has actually, has a cut-off of up until July 2020, 2024.

asr-000896
01:02:45.840 --> 01:02:48.780
Rep. Leila M. de Lima: So yung mga na-disqualify, yung mga exclude, hindi na sila umabot?

asr-000897
01:02:49.180 --> 01:02:50.120
Rep. Leila M. de Lima: So wala nang ibang rason?

asr-000898
01:02:50.660 --> 01:02:58.800
DAR Undersecretary for Field Operations Atty. Kazel C. Celeste: This could be a possible reason, ma'am, but we will definitely validate and provide your office with a more detailed explanation for this.

asr-000899
01:02:59.060 --> 01:03:00.260
Rep. Leila M. de Lima: I would appreciate that.

asr-000900
01:03:00.380 --> 01:03:02.720
Rep. Leila M. de Lima: Doon naman po tayo sa agricultural land conversion.

asr-000901
01:03:02.720 --> 01:03:06.720
Rep. Leila M. de Lima: Patuloy pa rin po ang reports ng illegal agricultural land.

asr-000902
01:03:06.840 --> 01:03:09.740
Rep. Leila M. de Lima: Agricultural land conversion despite existing regulations.

asr-000903
01:03:10.320 --> 01:03:18.300
Rep. Leila M. de Lima: Magkano po ang inilaan ng DAR para sa monitoring, detection, at enforcement laban sa illegal conversions?

asr-000904
01:03:18.940 --> 01:03:25.620
Rep. Leila M. de Lima: At ilan na po ang mga kasong na-aksyonan at successfully resolved ng DAR sa nakalipas na tatlong taon?

asr-000905
01:03:27.160 --> 01:03:31.020
Rep. Leila M. de Lima: So these are illegal land conversion because there are indeed reports on this.

asr-000906
01:03:31.500 --> 01:03:32.500
DAR Secretary Conrado M. Estrella III: Your Honor.

asr-000907
01:03:33.040 --> 01:03:33.560
Rep. Leila M. de Lima: Secretary.

asr-000908
01:03:33.560 --> 01:03:36.560
DAR Secretary Conrado M. Estrella III: Let me say that...

asr-000909
01:03:37.380 --> 01:03:43.560
DAR Secretary Conrado M. Estrella III: The illegal conversions, I don't think the DAR have done this, Your Honor.

asr-000910
01:03:43.880 --> 01:03:52.860
DAR Secretary Conrado M. Estrella III: But definitely there are many local government units that have made their own conversion, Your Honor.

asr-000911
01:03:53.720 --> 01:03:57.000
DAR Secretary Conrado M. Estrella III: And we are communicating with them also.

asr-000912
01:03:57.420 --> 01:04:01.920
Rep. Leila M. de Lima: I suppose DAR has been monitoring those cases of illegal land conversion.

asr-000913
01:04:01.920 --> 01:04:05.320
Rep. Leila M. de Lima: And you must have data and certain information about this.

asr-000914
01:04:05.440 --> 01:04:05.700
DAR Secretary Conrado M. Estrella III: Yes, Your Honor.

asr-000915
01:04:05.700 --> 01:04:06.480
Rep. Leila M. de Lima: And what do you do?

asr-000916
01:04:06.840 --> 01:04:08.040
Rep. Leila M. de Lima: With regard to that, that you are...

asr-000917
01:04:08.040 --> 01:04:16.540
DAR Secretary Conrado M. Estrella III: We call their attention, Your Honor, that they have illegally converted these lands.

asr-000918
01:04:17.540 --> 01:04:18.760
Rep. Leila M. de Lima: And then what happens next?

asr-000919
01:04:19.480 --> 01:04:23.040
DAR Secretary Conrado M. Estrella III: There are many, Your Honor, that they went back to DAR.

asr-000920
01:04:23.740 --> 01:04:29.940
DAR Secretary Conrado M. Estrella III: And they proceeded with the proper procedure, Your Honor.

asr-000921
01:04:31.280 --> 01:04:34.940
DAR Secretary Conrado M. Estrella III: In the first place, there's nothing to revoke because it is not...

asr-000922
01:04:35.480 --> 01:04:35.500
DAR Secretary Conrado M. Estrella III: Yes.

asr-000923
01:04:35.500 --> 01:04:36.820
DAR Secretary Conrado M. Estrella III: We don't recognize it.

asr-000924
01:04:36.840 --> 01:04:37.200
Rep. Leila M. de Lima: Yes.

asr-000925
01:04:38.540 --> 01:04:39.680
DAR Secretary Conrado M. Estrella III: But we...

asr-000926
01:04:39.680 --> 01:04:42.880
DAR Secretary Conrado M. Estrella III: The others, we called their attention, Your Honor.

asr-000927
01:04:44.060 --> 01:04:46.040
DAR Secretary Conrado M. Estrella III: At least those that we have monitored.

asr-000928
01:04:46.940 --> 01:04:48.840
DAR Secretary Conrado M. Estrella III: And some of...

asr-000929
01:04:48.840 --> 01:04:51.440
DAR Secretary Conrado M. Estrella III: Many of them have complied so far, Your Honor.

asr-000930
01:04:51.880 --> 01:04:52.520
Rep. Leila M. de Lima: Thank you for that.

asr-000931
01:04:52.600 --> 01:04:54.420
Rep. Leila M. de Lima: How much time do I have?

asr-000932
01:04:54.900 --> 01:04:55.680
Rep. Leila M. de Lima: Much time?

asr-000933
01:04:58.270 --> 01:05:00.070
Rep. Leila M. de Lima: Hindi ko po nakikita yung timer.

asr-000934
01:05:00.070 --> 01:05:01.650
Rep. Ian Paul L. Dy: You have 58 seconds, ma'am.

asr-000935
01:05:02.050 --> 01:05:02.530
Rep. Ian Paul L. Dy: One minute.

asr-000936
01:05:03.050 --> 01:05:03.590
Rep. Leila M. de Lima: One minute.

asr-000937
01:05:03.730 --> 01:05:03.970
Rep. Leila M. de Lima: Okay.

asr-000938
01:05:03.970 --> 01:05:05.970
Rep. Leila M. de Lima: So last...

asr-000939
01:05:05.970 --> 01:05:07.370
Rep. Leila M. de Lima: Kasi one minute na lang.

asr-000940
01:05:07.590 --> 01:05:08.410
Rep. Leila M. de Lima: I'd like to tackle...

asr-000941
01:05:08.570 --> 01:05:12.530
Rep. Leila M. de Lima: The case of Sariaya, Quezon.

asr-000942
01:05:13.570 --> 01:05:14.850
Rep. Leila M. de Lima: The Cloa Cancellation.

asr-000943
01:05:15.870 --> 01:05:18.190
Rep. Leila M. de Lima: Buhay na kaso po ito, hindi ho ba?

asr-000944
01:05:19.070 --> 01:05:24.350
Rep. Leila M. de Lima: Ang Cloa Cancellation at Land Conversion na nangyayari ngayon sa Sarayaya Quezon.

asr-000945
01:05:25.510 --> 01:05:26.490
Rep. Leila M. de Lima: Based on reports.

asr-000946
01:05:27.290 --> 01:05:31.010
Rep. Leila M. de Lima: May mga ulat po na ang mga magsasaka sa Manggalang Kiling,

asr-000947
01:05:31.230 --> 01:05:34.850
Rep. Leila M. de Lima: Concepcion 1 at Concepcion Pinagbakuran

asr-000948
01:05:34.850 --> 01:05:38.270
Rep. Leila M. de Lima: ay nawalan o posibleng mawalan ng kanilang mga Cloa.

asr-000949
01:05:38.570 --> 01:05:43.350
Rep. Leila M. de Lima: So ang tanong ko po, ilang po, ilang Cloa po sa Sarayaya Quezon

asr-000950
01:05:43.350 --> 01:05:47.150
Rep. Leila M. de Lima: ang na-revoke na o kasalukuyang subject to cancellation

asr-000951
01:05:47.150 --> 01:05:51.110
Rep. Leila M. de Lima: at ilang ARBs po ang apektado?

asr-000952
01:05:52.410 --> 01:05:58.490
DAR Secretary Conrado M. Estrella III: Your Honor, with the permission of the Chairman and the members of the Appropriation Committee,

asr-000953
01:05:59.270 --> 01:06:08.210
DAR Secretary Conrado M. Estrella III: our Undersecretary for Legal Concerns would address the concern, Your Honor.

asr-000954
01:06:08.570 --> 01:06:09.290
Rep. Ian Paul L. Dy: Yes, please.

asr-000955
01:06:09.370 --> 01:06:09.870
Rep. Ian Paul L. Dy: Of course.

asr-000956
01:06:11.130 --> 01:06:14.150
Rep. Ian Paul L. Dy: Yusek Napoleon Galit.

asr-000957
01:06:14.510 --> 01:06:15.010
Rep. Ian Paul L. Dy: Thank you.

asr-000958
01:06:16.250 --> 01:06:17.750
DAR Undersecretary for Legal Affairs Atty. Napoleon U. Galit: Magandang umaga po,

asr-000959
01:06:18.890 --> 01:06:24.210
DAR Undersecretary for Legal Affairs Atty. Napoleon U. Galit: Presiding Officers and Honorable Madam Layla.

asr-000960
01:06:25.150 --> 01:06:27.510
DAR Undersecretary for Legal Affairs Atty. Napoleon U. Galit: Iyong pong tungkol sa Sarayaya Quezon,

asr-000961
01:06:27.510 --> 01:06:30.790
DAR Undersecretary for Legal Affairs Atty. Napoleon U. Galit: there was a decision by the Supreme Court in 2018

asr-000962
01:06:30.790 --> 01:06:34.670
DAR Undersecretary for Legal Affairs Atty. Napoleon U. Galit: where the DAR coverage was nullified

asr-000963
01:06:34.670 --> 01:06:37.830
DAR Undersecretary for Legal Affairs Atty. Napoleon U. Galit: because the reason,

asr-000964
01:06:37.830 --> 01:06:40.570
DAR Undersecretary for Legal Affairs Atty. Napoleon U. Galit: the subject property was already exempted

asr-000965
01:06:40.570 --> 01:06:46.190
DAR Undersecretary for Legal Affairs Atty. Napoleon U. Galit: prior to the implementation of the CARP law

asr-000966
01:06:46.190 --> 01:06:48.330
DAR Undersecretary for Legal Affairs Atty. Napoleon U. Galit: which was on June 15, 1988.

asr-000967
01:06:49.430 --> 01:06:53.030
DAR Undersecretary for Legal Affairs Atty. Napoleon U. Galit: So the legal consequence of which is that

asr-000968
01:06:53.030 --> 01:07:00.370
DAR Undersecretary for Legal Affairs Atty. Napoleon U. Galit: our ARBs are facing the consequences of having their Cloas being cancelled.

asr-000969
01:07:01.530 --> 01:07:04.410
DAR Undersecretary for Legal Affairs Atty. Napoleon U. Galit: Now, the reason why this Cloas,

asr-000970
01:07:04.750 --> 01:07:06.650
DAR Undersecretary for Legal Affairs Atty. Napoleon U. Galit: despite the decision of the Supreme Court,

asr-000971
01:07:06.650 --> 01:07:07.650
DAR Undersecretary for Legal Affairs Atty. Napoleon U. Galit: are not yet cancelled,

asr-000972
01:07:07.830 --> 01:07:13.410
DAR Undersecretary for Legal Affairs Atty. Napoleon U. Galit: most of them, because we are trying to mediate on the part

asr-000973
01:07:13.410 --> 01:07:16.930
DAR Undersecretary for Legal Affairs Atty. Napoleon U. Galit: for and on behalf of the farmers, Madam Layla.

asr-000974
01:07:17.590 --> 01:07:20.710
DAR Undersecretary for Legal Affairs Atty. Napoleon U. Galit: For an instance, we are fighting for them

asr-000975
01:07:20.710 --> 01:07:25.730
DAR Undersecretary for Legal Affairs Atty. Napoleon U. Galit: under the rights under Republic Act 1199

asr-000976
01:07:25.730 --> 01:07:29.690
DAR Undersecretary for Legal Affairs Atty. Napoleon U. Galit: as amended by 1163

asr-000977
01:07:29.690 --> 01:07:33.690
DAR Undersecretary for Legal Affairs Atty. Napoleon U. Galit: and as further amended by Republic Act 3844.

asr-000978
01:07:33.690 --> 01:07:37.690
DAR Undersecretary for Legal Affairs Atty. Napoleon U. Galit: They are entitled to the security of the land.

asr-000979
01:07:37.830 --> 01:07:47.590
DAR Undersecretary for Legal Affairs Atty. Napoleon U. Galit: They are entitled to tenure and the disturbance compensation to their blissful being the tenant's right.

asr-000980
01:07:47.590 --> 01:07:53.990
DAR Undersecretary for Legal Affairs Atty. Napoleon U. Galit: Now, we are likewise conducting further mediation proceedings

asr-000981
01:07:53.990 --> 01:07:59.530
DAR Undersecretary for Legal Affairs Atty. Napoleon U. Galit: between the land owners who seems to have won the victory at the Supreme Court level.

asr-000982
01:08:00.530 --> 01:08:03.930
DAR Undersecretary for Legal Affairs Atty. Napoleon U. Galit: And that is why these farmers in Sarayaya Quezon

asr-000983
01:08:03.930 --> 01:08:06.830
DAR Undersecretary for Legal Affairs Atty. Napoleon U. Galit: are still occupying the land

asr-000984
01:08:06.830 --> 01:08:07.610
DAR Undersecretary for Legal Affairs Atty. Napoleon U. Galit: and still farming the land.

asr-000985
01:08:07.830 --> 01:08:14.830
DAR Undersecretary for Legal Affairs Atty. Napoleon U. Galit: And we continue to mediate despite the loss that the farmers have suffered.

asr-000986
01:08:14.830 --> 01:08:18.830
DAR Undersecretary for Legal Affairs Atty. Napoleon U. Galit: And of course, including the DAR in 2018

asr-000987
01:08:18.830 --> 01:08:21.830
DAR Undersecretary for Legal Affairs Atty. Napoleon U. Galit: on account of that decision by the Supreme Court.

asr-000988
01:08:21.830 --> 01:08:22.830
DAR Undersecretary for Legal Affairs Atty. Napoleon U. Galit: Madam Layla.

asr-000989
01:08:22.830 --> 01:08:26.830
Rep. Leila M. de Lima: Just a follow-up question on that.

asr-000990
01:08:26.830 --> 01:08:32.830
Rep. Leila M. de Lima: So, hindi ba pinapakita po nito na may gaps or deficiencies sa naging proseso ng DAR

asr-000991
01:08:32.830 --> 01:08:36.830
Rep. Leila M. de Lima: sa original land acquisition validation?

asr-000992
01:08:36.830 --> 01:08:38.830
Rep. Leila M. de Lima: At titling?

asr-000993
01:08:38.830 --> 01:08:41.830
Rep. Leila M. de Lima: Kung mayroon po, ano ang mga hakbang ng DAR

asr-000994
01:08:41.830 --> 01:08:47.830
Rep. Leila M. de Lima: para maitama ang mga pagkukulang na ito at maiwasang maulit ang ganito mga kaso?

asr-000995
01:08:47.830 --> 01:08:50.830
DAR Undersecretary for Legal Affairs Atty. Napoleon U. Galit: Madam, Madam Layla.

asr-000996
01:08:50.830 --> 01:08:54.830
Rep. Leila M. de Lima: There must be some deficiencies or gaps there in the original.

asr-000997
01:08:54.830 --> 01:09:02.830
DAR Undersecretary for Legal Affairs Atty. Napoleon U. Galit: The decision, the situation which brought about this kind of situation

asr-000998
01:09:02.830 --> 01:09:04.830
DAR Undersecretary for Legal Affairs Atty. Napoleon U. Galit: was because

asr-000999
01:09:04.830 --> 01:09:09.830
DAR Undersecretary for Legal Affairs Atty. Napoleon U. Galit: in the implementation of the CARP law, Madam Layla,

asr-001000
01:09:09.830 --> 01:09:17.830
DAR Undersecretary for Legal Affairs Atty. Napoleon U. Galit: the DAR normally is very desirous to cover every land holdings

asr-001001
01:09:17.830 --> 01:09:23.830
DAR Undersecretary for Legal Affairs Atty. Napoleon U. Galit: which has the character of a private agricultural or a government agricultural land holdings.

asr-001002
01:09:23.830 --> 01:09:30.830
DAR Undersecretary for Legal Affairs Atty. Napoleon U. Galit: Nonetheless, there are situations where after the coverage, the notice of coverage,

asr-001003
01:09:30.830 --> 01:09:33.830
DAR Undersecretary for Legal Affairs Atty. Napoleon U. Galit: and in fact, very sadly stated,

asr-001004
01:09:33.830 --> 01:09:35.830
DAR Undersecretary for Legal Affairs Atty. Napoleon U. Galit: even after CLUAS were issued,

asr-001005
01:09:35.830 --> 01:09:42.830
DAR Undersecretary for Legal Affairs Atty. Napoleon U. Galit: where a particular land owner came up with evidence for an instance

asr-001006
01:09:42.830 --> 01:09:46.830
DAR Undersecretary for Legal Affairs Atty. Napoleon U. Galit: of a reclassification issued by the local government units,

asr-001007
01:09:46.830 --> 01:09:50.830
DAR Undersecretary for Legal Affairs Atty. Napoleon U. Galit: which has an affirmative approval from the DSOD,

asr-001008
01:09:50.830 --> 01:09:55.830
DAR Undersecretary for Legal Affairs Atty. Napoleon U. Galit: recently DSOD before the HLURV or the NCV.

asr-001009
01:09:55.830 --> 01:10:01.830
DAR Undersecretary for Legal Affairs Atty. Napoleon U. Galit: And that is the reason why in the exercise of adjudicatory power of DAR,

asr-001010
01:10:01.830 --> 01:10:04.830
DAR Undersecretary for Legal Affairs Atty. Napoleon U. Galit: we adjudicate this case.

asr-001011
01:10:04.830 --> 01:10:14.830
DAR Undersecretary for Legal Affairs Atty. Napoleon U. Galit: However, despite the fact that several farmers have won at the level of the Office of the Secretary before the DAR,

asr-001012
01:10:14.830 --> 01:10:18.830
DAR Undersecretary for Legal Affairs Atty. Napoleon U. Galit: on appeal to the Court of Appeals and to the Supreme Court,

asr-001013
01:10:18.830 --> 01:10:19.830
DAR Undersecretary for Legal Affairs Atty. Napoleon U. Galit: we lost the case.

asr-001014
01:10:19.830 --> 01:10:29.530
DAR Undersecretary for Legal Affairs Atty. Napoleon U. Galit: This is the situation of the heirs of GALA versus the samahan ng mamamamayan ng saryaya.

asr-001015
01:10:29.530 --> 01:10:32.900
Rep. Ian Paul L. Dy: Your time is up, ma'am.

asr-001016
01:10:32.900 --> 01:10:33.900
Rep. Leila M. de Lima: Salamat po.

asr-001017
01:10:33.900 --> 01:10:34.900
Rep. Leila M. de Lima: Maraming salamat, DAR.

asr-001018
01:10:34.900 --> 01:10:35.900
Rep. Leila M. de Lima: Thank you.

asr-001019
01:10:35.900 --> 01:10:36.900
Rep. Ian Paul L. Dy: Thank you.

asr-001020
01:10:36.900 --> 01:10:41.900
Rep. Ian Paul L. Dy: Now, we move on to Representative Arnie Fuentebella.

asr-001021
01:10:41.900 --> 01:10:44.900
Rep. Ian Paul L. Dy: And could we have a short recess?

asr-001022
01:10:44.900 --> 01:10:47.900
Rep. Ian Paul L. Dy: Intayin lang natin si Sec.

asr-001023
01:10:47.900 --> 01:10:48.900
Rep. Ian Paul L. Dy: May si Arne lang.

asr-001024
01:10:48.900 --> 01:10:54.100
Rep. Ian Paul L. Dy: Session suspended.

asr-001025
01:12:08.440 --> 01:12:09.440
Rep. Ian Paul L. Dy: Okay.

asr-001026
01:12:09.440 --> 01:12:10.440
Rep. Ian Paul L. Dy: Alright.

asr-001027
01:12:10.440 --> 01:12:14.440
Rep. Ian Paul L. Dy: May we hear from Rep. Arne Fuentabelia, please?

asr-001028
01:12:15.440 --> 01:12:16.440
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: Thank you, Chair.

asr-001029
01:12:17.440 --> 01:12:27.300
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: Actually, pinasuspend natin dahil gusto kong marinig ni Sec. Estrella.

asr-001030
01:12:27.300 --> 01:12:36.300
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: First of all, I would like to commend, congratulate Sec. Estrella for your leadership sa DAR.

asr-001031
01:12:36.300 --> 01:12:39.300
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: Napakarami po nang nagawa niyo.

asr-001032
01:12:39.300 --> 01:12:41.300
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: Congratulations.

asr-001033
01:12:41.300 --> 01:12:46.300
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: And I would like to manifest my support regarding your budget.

asr-001034
01:12:46.300 --> 01:12:48.300
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: And even kung may additional po kayo,

asr-001035
01:12:48.300 --> 01:12:50.300
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: may additional po kayong hihingin,

asr-001036
01:12:50.300 --> 01:12:53.300
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: susuporta rin po ako doon.

asr-001037
01:12:53.300 --> 01:12:55.300
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: So, Sec. Estrella has been a...

asr-001038
01:12:55.300 --> 01:12:58.300
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: Ba't nag-destart yung time ko? Wala pa naman akong tanong.

asr-001039
01:12:58.300 --> 01:13:00.300
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: Pakihulit nyo nga yan.

asr-001040
01:13:00.300 --> 01:13:02.300
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: Hoy.

asr-001041
01:13:02.300 --> 01:13:04.300
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: Nasa upro din ako.

asr-001042
01:13:04.300 --> 01:13:07.300
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: Vice-Chair ako. Alam ko yung ginagawa ko.

asr-001043
01:13:07.300 --> 01:13:09.300
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: Congratulations.

asr-001044
01:13:09.300 --> 01:13:13.300
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: Manong congrats, Estrella has been a colleague of my father,

asr-001045
01:13:13.300 --> 01:13:16.300
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: my brother, and even my boss.

asr-001046
01:13:16.300 --> 01:13:17.300
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: Yeah.

asr-001047
01:13:17.300 --> 01:13:22.300
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: We elected si Speaker Lord Velasco.

asr-001048
01:13:22.300 --> 01:13:24.300
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: He was the Deputy Speaker then.

asr-001049
01:13:24.300 --> 01:13:27.300
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: So, congratulations, Sir.

asr-001050
01:13:27.300 --> 01:13:33.300
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: But, Sir, I just have some verificatory questions,

asr-001051
01:13:33.300 --> 01:13:35.300
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: policy questions.

asr-001052
01:13:35.300 --> 01:13:49.300
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: It may sound, Sir, parokyal,

