asr-001125
01:18:58.340 --> 01:18:59.020
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: Is this correct?

asr-001126
01:18:59.300 --> 01:19:00.140
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: Do you have the knowledge?

asr-001127
01:19:00.940 --> 01:19:01.480
DAR Undersecretary for Field Operations Atty. Kazel C. Celeste: Yes, sir.

asr-001128
01:19:01.720 --> 01:19:01.980
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: Yes.

asr-001129
01:19:01.980 --> 01:19:22.200
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: And on December 2025, DAR distributed a total of 3,497 land titles to 2,697 ARBs covering 5,929.36 hectares of agricultural land, including agricultural lands in Sonoma.

asr-001130
