Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: And the distribution was attended by...

asr-001131
01:19:25.640 --> 01:19:32.400
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: By the DAR Secretary himself, Secretary Conrad Estrella, and the Governor of Camarines World.

asr-001132
01:19:32.460 --> 01:19:33.120
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: Is this correct?

asr-001133
01:19:34.700 --> 01:19:36.160
DAR Undersecretary for Field Operations Atty. Kazel C. Celeste: As far as I know, yes, sir.

asr-001134
01:19:36.160 --> 01:19:43.640
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: Yes, because my point is, kung na-issue yung title ng Wanderlust noong February 2024,

asr-001135
01:19:45.100 --> 01:19:55.380
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: bakit hindi sila nag-complain na nagbibigay ng CLOA si Secretary and the Governor sa mga beneficiaries?

asr-001136
