Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: Tama?

asr-001142
01:20:10.720 --> 01:20:21.480
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: So, at any time during after the distribution, did the Provincial Governor raise any concern to DAR regarding Wanderlust title, CLOA, and overlaps?

