DAR Undersecretary for Field Operations Atty. Kazel C. Celeste: No, none, sir.

asr-001144
01:20:24.480 --> 01:20:25.140
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: Walang angal.

asr-001145
01:20:25.140 --> 01:20:25.480
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: Okay.

asr-001146
01:20:27.040 --> 01:20:39.160
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: Please provide within the week the financial certified list and technical plotting or survey plan showing all CLOAs and collective CLOAs that overlap with Wanderlust title.

asr-001147
01:20:40.220 --> 01:20:48.040
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: All portions of the NARA settlement that overlap with the Wanderlust title, kindly submit to this committee.

asr-001148
01:20:48.800 --> 01:20:48.900
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: Okay.

asr-001149
01:20:49.720 --> 01:20:50.360
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: Next question.

asr-001150
01:20:50.360 --> 01:20:57.020
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: Are titles, OCT, TCTs, or CLOA issued to ARBs given equal treatment as title?

asr-001153
01:20:57.180 --> 01:21:03.120
DAR Undersecretary for Field Operations Atty. Kazel C. Celeste: Yes, sir. That's OCT.

asr-001154
01:21:03.580 --> 01:21:06.460
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: Yes. Free patent, sales patent, etc.

asr-001155
01:21:06.960 --> 01:21:12.740
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: What is the official position of DAR regarding the overlap of Wanderlust title with CLOA issued to ARBs?

asr-001156
01:21:13.880 --> 01:21:20.100
DAR Undersecretary for Field Operations Atty. Kazel C. Celeste: We are exploring, sir, the options that is at our office.

asr-001157
01:21:20.100 --> 01:21:26.100
DAR Undersecretary for Field Operations Atty. Kazel C. Celeste: At the moment, po, there is an ALI case which has been filed by some ARBs.

asr-001158
01:21:27.040 --> 01:21:36.580
DAR Undersecretary for Field Operations Atty. Kazel C. Celeste: It's a petition for, it's a disturbance of possession in the area affected by the fencing.

asr-001159
01:21:37.720 --> 01:21:39.060
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: So, you saw the fencing?

asr-001160
01:21:39.720 --> 01:21:40.120
DAR Undersecretary for Field Operations Atty. Kazel C. Celeste: Yes, sir.

asr-001161
01:21:40.320 --> 01:21:40.580
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: Yes.

asr-001162
01:21:41.440 --> 01:21:48.500
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: So, is DAR, is it the opinion of DAR, is DAR of the opinion that Wanderlust title is purious?

asr-001163
01:21:52.370 --> 01:21:53.050
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: Theoretically.

asr-001164
01:21:54.650 --> 01:21:56.090
DAR Undersecretary for Field Operations Atty. Kazel C. Celeste: At the moment, sir.

asr-001165
01:21:56.090 --> 01:21:56.890
DAR Undersecretary for Field Operations Atty. Kazel C. Celeste: For example, sir.

asr-001166
01:21:58.390 --> 01:22:04.170
DAR Undersecretary for Field Operations Atty. Kazel C. Celeste: At the moment, sir, we cannot.

asr-001167
01:22:04.170 --> 01:22:08.690
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: Are we allowed na magkaroon ng titulo ang dagat?

asr-001168
01:22:10.690 --> 01:22:11.670
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: Dagat, may titulo?

asr-001169
01:22:15.220 --> 01:22:16.800
DAR Undersecretary for Field Operations Atty. Kazel C. Celeste: Wala. Hindi po. Wala.

asr-001170
01:22:17.200 --> 01:22:20.760
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: I'm just asking for your opinion. So, don't worry.

asr-001171
01:22:21.860 --> 01:22:22.640
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: So, what's your opinion?

asr-001172
01:22:24.320 --> 01:22:27.560
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: Any legal, sir?

asr-001173
01:22:29.180 --> 01:22:30.000
Rep. Ian Paul L. Dy: Usec Galit?

asr-001174
01:22:30.300 --> 01:22:33.600
DAR Undersecretary for Legal Affairs Atty. Napoleon U. Galit: If given the permission by the, or should I say, okay.

asr-001175
01:22:34.460 --> 01:22:42.020
DAR Undersecretary for Legal Affairs Atty. Napoleon U. Galit: Honorable sir, the topic you are touching is with regard to overlapping of titles.

asr-001176
01:22:42.540 --> 01:22:51.800
DAR Undersecretary for Legal Affairs Atty. Napoleon U. Galit: There seems to be titles issued in favor of Wanderlust, while there are a lot of two was already issued also to our ARBs.

asr-001177
01:22:52.540 --> 01:22:57.860
DAR Undersecretary for Legal Affairs Atty. Napoleon U. Galit: So, this is a case of two conflicting titles over the same parcel of land.

asr-001178
01:22:58.660 --> 01:22:58.920
DAR Undersecretary for Legal Affairs Atty. Napoleon U. Galit: Yes.

asr-001179
01:22:58.920 --> 01:23:03.620
DAR Undersecretary for Legal Affairs Atty. Napoleon U. Galit: In such a situation, under Republic Act 496, as amended by PD,

asr-001180
01:23:03.640 --> 01:23:07.280
DAR Undersecretary for Legal Affairs Atty. Napoleon U. Galit: 1529, one title must be cancelled.

asr-001181
01:23:07.800 --> 01:23:08.060
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: Yes.

asr-001182
01:23:08.740 --> 01:23:19.580
DAR Undersecretary for Legal Affairs Atty. Napoleon U. Galit: I am agreeable with the position of the honorable representative that forest land cannot be subject to titling,

asr-001183
01:23:20.140 --> 01:23:22.700
DAR Undersecretary for Legal Affairs Atty. Napoleon U. Galit: as well as forest land cannot be subject to titling.

asr-001184
01:23:23.640 --> 01:23:31.380
DAR Undersecretary for Legal Affairs Atty. Napoleon U. Galit: The remedy of that under Common Act 141, as amended by Presidential Decree 705,

asr-001185
01:23:31.460 --> 01:23:33.340
DAR Undersecretary for Legal Affairs Atty. Napoleon U. Galit: is an action for reversion to the State

asr-001186
01:23:33.640 --> 01:23:37.240
DAR Undersecretary for Legal Affairs Atty. Napoleon U. Galit: to be filed by the Office of the Solicitor General.

asr-001187
01:23:38.040 --> 01:23:44.140
DAR Undersecretary for Legal Affairs Atty. Napoleon U. Galit: However, those CLOAs that were already issued on those portions that were found to be alienable and disposable,

asr-001188
01:23:44.940 --> 01:23:48.480
DAR Undersecretary for Legal Affairs Atty. Napoleon U. Galit: they should remain free from whatever claims from the Wanderlust.

asr-001189
01:23:48.860 --> 01:23:49.760
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: Thank you for that.

asr-001190
01:23:50.000 --> 01:23:50.520
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: Thank you.

asr-001191
01:23:50.880 --> 01:23:51.140
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: Yes.

asr-001192
01:23:51.140 --> 01:23:54.340
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: And during its budget hearing last August 26,

asr-001193
01:23:55.140 --> 01:24:02.280
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: the DENR stated that it's preparing to file a reversion case against Wanderlust in the second week of October 2026.

asr-001194
01:24:03.200 --> 01:24:03.340
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: Yes.

asr-001195
01:24:03.340 --> 01:24:06.340
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: Because Timberland was involved in that.

asr-001196
01:24:07.740 --> 01:24:10.360
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: So, I know this is not your problem.

asr-001197
01:24:10.860 --> 01:24:13.100
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: But we're going to file a bill.

asr-001198
01:24:13.480 --> 01:24:14.380
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: Later I'll explain.

asr-001199
01:24:15.200 --> 01:24:20.780
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: These two recovered at Timberland and bodies of other being claimed by Wanderlust under this questionable title.

asr-001200
01:24:21.500 --> 01:24:27.800
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: Has the DNR coordinated with the DNR in relation to the reversion case that is set to be filed?

asr-001201
01:24:28.620 --> 01:24:30.880
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: Considering the matter is interrelated.

asr-001202
01:24:30.880 --> 01:24:32.880
DAR Undersecretary for Legal Affairs Atty. Napoleon U. Galit: The incident is ongoing coordination.

asr-001203
01:24:33.340 --> 01:24:38.440
DAR Undersecretary for Legal Affairs Atty. Napoleon U. Galit: With the proper agency, your honor, the OSG and the DNR.

asr-001204
01:24:38.940 --> 01:24:39.160
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: Yes.

asr-001205
01:24:39.460 --> 01:24:43.720
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: We're still not at the OSG because we're still here for the survey.

asr-001206
01:24:44.120 --> 01:24:45.420
DAR Undersecretary for Legal Affairs Atty. Napoleon U. Galit: That is an ongoing concern.

asr-001207
01:24:45.960 --> 01:24:49.220
DAR Undersecretary for Legal Affairs Atty. Napoleon U. Galit: Asking consultation, your honor, to the OSG.

asr-001208
01:24:49.380 --> 01:24:49.960
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: Yes, please.

asr-001209
01:24:50.080 --> 01:24:50.560
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: Yes, please.

asr-001210
01:24:50.640 --> 01:24:51.480
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: Kindly help us.

asr-001211
01:24:52.960 --> 01:24:55.900
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: Does the ARB plan to file a similar case against Wanderlust?

asr-001212
01:24:57.060 --> 01:25:00.840
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: Ensuring the protection of ARBs and their corresponding CLOAs.

asr-001213
01:25:00.840 --> 01:25:00.960
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: Yes.

asr-001214
01:25:01.860 --> 01:25:03.200
DAR Undersecretary for Legal Affairs Atty. Napoleon U. Galit: As far as the ARBs.

asr-001215
01:25:03.340 --> 01:25:06.780
DAR Undersecretary for Legal Affairs Atty. Napoleon U. Galit: As far as the ARBs are concerned, DAR is mandated to protect the interests of our farmers.

asr-001216
01:25:07.720 --> 01:25:07.980
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: Yes.

asr-001217
01:25:08.220 --> 01:25:11.480
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: Do you have a timetable of filing a reversion case?

