asr-002378
02:04:03.880 --> 02:04:15.240
DAR Undersecretary for Legal Affairs Atty. Napoleon U. Galit: Ngayon po, yung pong mga farmers na yan na Honorable Ma'am, kinanagpile sila ng conversion.

asr-002379
02:04:15.460 --> 02:04:18.560
DAR Undersecretary for Legal Affairs Atty. Napoleon U. Galit: Ang pagmamayari po, nasa kanila pa rin po.

asr-002380
02:04:19.500 --> 02:04:24.620
