asr-002381
02:04:25.340 --> 02:04:36.300
DAR Undersecretary for Legal Affairs Atty. Napoleon U. Galit: So, in which case, yung pong debilo fair at saka yung agrarian reform beneficiaries, nagsishare po sila sa pakinabang ng lupa na kanilang sinasaka.

asr-002382
02:04:37.700 --> 02:04:39.540
DAR Undersecretary for Legal Affairs Atty. Napoleon U. Galit: Marami po yun. Tama po kayo.

asr-002383
02:04:40.200 --> 02:04:44.220
DAR Undersecretary for Legal Affairs Atty. Napoleon U. Galit: Marami po sa nag-a-apply ng conversion, karamihan po ay manggagawa.

