02:06:45.340 --> 02:06:50.700
DAR Undersecretary for Legal Affairs Atty. Napoleon U. Galit: ng land holdings na nakapag-apply ng conversion,

asr-002414
02:06:50.940 --> 02:06:53.340
DAR Undersecretary for Legal Affairs Atty. Napoleon U. Galit: kung ilan ang mga farmers ang nag-apply ng conversions,

asr-002415
02:06:54.020 --> 02:07:01.340
