Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Now, there is this study.

asr-002419
02:07:15.340 --> 02:07:20.100
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Conducted by the UP Department of Geodetic Engineering

asr-002420
02:07:20.100 --> 02:07:26.020
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: tungkol po sa issue ng land use conversion sa probinsya ng Tarla.

asr-002421
02:07:26.420 --> 02:07:30.520
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: At sa kanilang pag-aaral mula 2017 hanggang 2022,

asr-002422
02:07:31.080 --> 02:07:37.720
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: ang agricultural lands ay lumiit from 50.19% to 47.64%

asr-002423
02:07:37.720 --> 02:07:44.720
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: habang nag-triple naman sa bilang at porsyento, 333.3%.

asr-002424
02:07:45.340 --> 02:07:48.680
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Ang expansion ng mga solar farms.

asr-002425
02:07:49.420 --> 02:07:51.960
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Ito ho ba ay alam ng DAR?

asr-002426
02:07:52.360 --> 02:07:59.700
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: At ano ho ang sinasagawa natin para matiyak na napoprotektahan pa rin natin ang ating agricultural lands?

asr-002427
02:07:59.840 --> 02:08:05.980
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Ang kasabay nitong malawakan at mabilisan na expansion ng mga solar farms.

asr-002428
02:08:07.320 --> 02:08:08.640
DAR Undersecretary for Legal Affairs Atty. Napoleon U. Galit: Ganito po yan, Ma'am.

asr-002429
02:08:08.920 --> 02:08:12.920
DAR Undersecretary for Legal Affairs Atty. Napoleon U. Galit: Yung pong dalawang niyang bahagi, yung pong para sa elektrisidad,

asr-002430
02:08:13.860 --> 02:08:15.180
DAR Undersecretary for Legal Affairs Atty. Napoleon U. Galit: at saka yung...

asr-002431
02:08:15.340 --> 02:08:20.560
DAR Undersecretary for Legal Affairs Atty. Napoleon U. Galit: Yung pong tungkol sa ating mga ARBs, sa ating mga farmers,

asr-002432
02:08:21.320 --> 02:08:28.300
DAR Undersecretary for Legal Affairs Atty. Napoleon U. Galit: ito po ay parihas sa binabanggit at pinapaprotektahan din ho ng ating saligang batas.

asr-002433
02:08:29.120 --> 02:08:34.480
DAR Undersecretary for Legal Affairs Atty. Napoleon U. Galit: Yung pong sa mga farmers, ang tinatawag po natin na protection na ibinibigay dyan ay yung social justice.

asr-002434
02:08:34.480 --> 02:08:43.480
DAR Undersecretary for Legal Affairs Atty. Napoleon U. Galit: Ang tungkol sa pagpapalago ng agraryo, which is, according to our president, is a foundational approach.

asr-002435
02:08:43.480 --> 02:08:51.960
DAR Undersecretary for Legal Affairs Atty. Napoleon U. Galit: At yung isa naman po, elektrisidad, pangangailangan din po ng buong Pilipino, ng buong kabayanan,

asr-002436
02:08:52.620 --> 02:09:00.620
DAR Undersecretary for Legal Affairs Atty. Napoleon U. Galit: na atin namang pinapangalagaan ng ating 1987 Constitution, na tinatawag naman po natin na General Welfare Clause.

asr-002437
02:09:01.280 --> 02:09:04.900
DAR Undersecretary for Legal Affairs Atty. Napoleon U. Galit: Ito po ay parihas namin binabalansi at inaalagaan.

asr-002438
02:09:04.900 --> 02:09:12.960
DAR Undersecretary for Legal Affairs Atty. Napoleon U. Galit: Kaya nga po, dito kapag dumating na sa amin ang isang application for conversions under the Land Use Case Committee,

asr-002439
02:09:13.480 --> 02:09:20.400
DAR Undersecretary for Legal Affairs Atty. Napoleon U. Galit: at nakita namin kay farmers siya na nag-apply, kay regular land owners siya na nag-apply,

asr-002440
02:09:21.220 --> 02:09:25.920
DAR Undersecretary for Legal Affairs Atty. Napoleon U. Galit: tapos kumplito ang requirement niya at naaayon sa batas.

asr-002441
02:09:26.540 --> 02:09:35.080
DAR Undersecretary for Legal Affairs Atty. Napoleon U. Galit: Kami po, ma'am, ay wala rin hong discretion kasi kundi ang ibigay at i-approve ang kanyang konversyon.

asr-002442
02:09:35.400 --> 02:09:42.360
DAR Undersecretary for Legal Affairs Atty. Napoleon U. Galit: Ngayon po, tungkol po doon sa ginagawang inventory ng ibang ahinsya ng pamahalaan,

asr-002443
02:09:42.360 --> 02:09:54.040
DAR Undersecretary for Legal Affairs Atty. Napoleon U. Galit: tama lang po iyon at kami po ay magkipag-coordinate sa kanila para makipag-exchange note kami tungkol naman sa data namin dito sa DAR

asr-002444
02:09:54.040 --> 02:10:05.020
DAR Undersecretary for Legal Affairs Atty. Napoleon U. Galit: at saka doon sa ahinsya na nag-conduct din ng kanilang tinatawag na survey na parang lumiliit ang agricultural lot

asr-002445
02:10:05.020 --> 02:10:09.140
DAR Undersecretary for Legal Affairs Atty. Napoleon U. Galit: because of the conversion of this renewable energy.

asr-002446
02:10:09.760 --> 02:10:12.340
DAR Undersecretary for Legal Affairs Atty. Napoleon U. Galit: Natural lang po, ma'am, hindi po ako pupunta.

asr-002447
02:10:12.360 --> 02:10:19.000
DAR Undersecretary for Legal Affairs Atty. Napoleon U. Galit: Kung pwedeng makatanggi na kapag nagkaroon ng konversyon, nakakabawas sa ating agricultural.

asr-002448
02:10:19.960 --> 02:10:29.220
DAR Undersecretary for Legal Affairs Atty. Napoleon U. Galit: Pero sa akin, ang masasabi ko po, supesyente pa rin po ang lawak ng kalupaan para po sa ating agricultural

asr-002449
02:10:29.220 --> 02:10:34.060
DAR Undersecretary for Legal Affairs Atty. Napoleon U. Galit: na nangangailangan lang po ng suporta ng modern agriculture.

asr-002450
02:10:34.840 --> 02:10:39.700
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Ang Department of Agriculture, Mr. Chair, meron silang sinisimula na geofencing program

asr-002451
02:10:39.700 --> 02:10:41.700
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: para protektahan yung ating agriculture.

asr-002452
02:10:42.360 --> 02:10:42.780
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: At sa akin, ang mga ating agricultural lands.

asr-002453
02:10:42.840 --> 02:10:47.040
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Dahil tama po kayo, parehong napakahalaga sa sambayan ng Pilipino.

asr-002454
02:10:47.200 --> 02:10:52.580
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Pero kailangan din natin tiyakin na kung gaano tayo kabilis na mag-approve ba ng expansion,

asr-002455
02:10:53.180 --> 02:10:57.840
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: ng development ng mga bagong solar at iba pang mga renewable energy projects

asr-002456
02:10:57.840 --> 02:11:02.760
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: na hindi po natin tinututulan, sinusuportahan po natin ang mga renewable energy projects.

asr-002457
02:11:02.940 --> 02:11:07.660
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Pero hindi dapat natin maisakripisyo naman yung ating mga prime agricultural lands.

asr-002458
02:11:07.660 --> 02:11:12.300
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: And ganyan din yung lupa, kabuhayan ng ating mga magsasaka.

asr-002459
02:11:12.360 --> 02:11:14.320
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Gayon din ang mga manggagawang bukid.

asr-002460
02:11:14.320 --> 02:11:30.840
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Kaya, Mr. Chair, kaugnay nito, sabi ng BCDA, ang proposed Pax Silica ay humigit kumulang na 4,000 acres o nasa 1,619 hectares sa New Clark City.

asr-002461
02:11:31.560 --> 02:11:40.720
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Sabi naman ng Capas Municipal Government, over 30% ng land area ay considered productive agricultural land.

asr-002462
02:11:40.720 --> 02:11:48.260
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Alam po ba ito ng DAR? At nag-issue po ba ang DAR ng mga conversion order na kaugnay ng proyekto na ito?

asr-002463
02:11:48.920 --> 02:12:01.800
DAR Undersecretary for Legal Affairs Atty. Napoleon U. Galit: Patungkol po diyan sa Pax Silica, ang masasabi ko po sa inyo, wala pa pong nag-a-apply dito ng kahit na anong entities para po mag-apply ng conversion.

asr-002464
02:12:01.800 --> 02:12:10.700
DAR Undersecretary for Legal Affairs Atty. Napoleon U. Galit: Ang masasabi ko dyan, maski na ang BCDA na host charter under Republic Act 7227,

asr-002465
02:12:10.720 --> 02:12:23.680
DAR Undersecretary for Legal Affairs Atty. Napoleon U. Galit: ay mayroon din mandate, mayroon din silang mandato, mayroon silang kapangyarihan na magka-exorcise ng expropriation o tinatawag natin na power of eminent domain.

asr-002466
02:12:24.620 --> 02:12:37.220
DAR Undersecretary for Legal Affairs Atty. Napoleon U. Galit: Ang aming pong protection na ibinibigay sa ARBs, kung sakasakaling dumating sa punto na yung lupa na nasasakop nila at may kluwa at tatamaan ng expropriation,

asr-002467
02:12:37.220 --> 02:12:40.560
DAR Undersecretary for Legal Affairs Atty. Napoleon U. Galit: we will definitely contest the validity.

asr-002468
02:12:40.720 --> 02:12:48.520
DAR Undersecretary for Legal Affairs Atty. Napoleon U. Galit: of the exercise of the power of eminent domain by the PAC silika or even the BCDA to that effect.

asr-002469
02:12:48.940 --> 02:12:55.940
DAR Undersecretary for Legal Affairs Atty. Napoleon U. Galit: There are a lot of situations where we entangled and we are in conflict with the BCDA and the DAR.

asr-002470
02:12:55.940 --> 02:13:07.760
DAR Undersecretary for Legal Affairs Atty. Napoleon U. Galit: And we do not bow our heads just simply because they are also an agency empowered with the power of expropriation.

asr-002471
02:13:08.200 --> 02:13:10.660
DAR Undersecretary for Legal Affairs Atty. Napoleon U. Galit: We continue to maintain our mandate.

asr-002472
02:13:10.720 --> 02:13:13.300
DAR Undersecretary for Legal Affairs Atty. Napoleon U. Galit: To protect the interest of the farmers, ma'am.

asr-002473
02:13:14.500 --> 02:13:28.720
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Maari nyo bang maimbestigahan itong ulat na lumabas na ang BCDA daw ho ay nag-offer sa landowners at farmers ng 30 pesos per square meter or around 300,000 pesos per hectare

asr-002474
02:13:29.600 --> 02:13:35.960
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: sa, dito po sa mga lupa na natukoy po natin ng mga productive agricultural lands.

asr-002475
02:13:36.100 --> 02:13:40.700
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Maari nyo po bang maimbestigahan at matiyak po natin na katulad po ng sabi ninyo,

asr-002476
02:13:40.720 --> 02:13:50.100
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: ay maprotektahan po natin yung kabuhayan at interest mismo ng ating mga magsasaka at mga katutubo.

asr-002477
02:13:50.100 --> 02:13:55.260
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Gayon din, Mr. Chair, gusto ko lang din po masabi sa harap ng ating committee,

asr-002478
02:13:55.560 --> 02:14:03.520
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: sa totoo lang ho nais namin matanong mismo yung BCDA sa mga katanungan na ito tungkol sa PAC silika.

asr-002479
02:14:03.720 --> 02:14:07.780
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Kasi ho, lahat ho ng mga departamento na tinatanong namin tungkol dito,

asr-002480
02:14:07.980 --> 02:14:10.300
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: ang itinuturo ho sa amin, BCDA daw ho,

asr-002481
02:14:10.300 --> 02:14:11.460
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: ang nangunguna.

asr-002482
02:14:12.060 --> 02:14:20.740
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Ngunit, hindi po tayo mabibigyan niya ng pagkakataon kasi wala po sa schedule ng mga budget briefings sa harap ng Committee on Appropriations.

asr-002483
02:14:21.080 --> 02:14:26.220
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Sumulat na ho kami sa Committee on Appropriations tungkol dito at muli ho kaming nananawagan.

asr-002484
02:14:26.400 --> 02:14:37.620
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Dapat ho, masagot itong katanungan ng taong bayan tungkol sa PAC silika at paharapin ng BCDA sa harap ng Committee on Appropriations at sa Kongreso na ito.

asr-002485
02:14:37.620 --> 02:14:39.440
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Ang ngayon naman, Mr. Chair,

asr-002486
02:14:40.300 --> 02:14:41.520
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: sa EO 75,

asr-002487
02:14:42.620 --> 02:14:49.740
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: meron na ho ba kayong report tungkol sa execution ng Executive Order No. 75

asr-002488
02:14:49.740 --> 02:14:57.260
