DAR Undersecretary for Legal Affairs Atty. Napoleon U. Galit: Ang mapatungkol po sa...

asr-002490
02:15:00.000 --> 02:15:12.580
DAR Undersecretary for Legal Affairs Atty. Napoleon U. Galit: Executive Order 75, which covers government-owned land, kung tawagin namin ay GOL, na may pinanggalingan din yan na isang Executive Order earlier issued during the time of President Cory Aquino,

asr-002491
02:15:13.320 --> 02:15:27.000
DAR Undersecretary for Legal Affairs Atty. Napoleon U. Galit: Executive Order 407, ay isang bagay na kahit na pinahinto na kami sa aming pag-cover sa mga private agricultural lands, ay patuloy pa rin namin ginagawa ito.

asr-002492
02:15:27.000 --> 02:15:52.580
DAR Undersecretary for Legal Affairs Atty. Napoleon U. Galit: Katunayan dito, noong nakaraang three weeks ago, nag-order ang aming kagalanggalang nakalihim, Sekretary Conrado Estrella, na paboran ang isang acquisition sa government-owned land under our position that the same has already been converted into alienable and disposable dito sa Cagayan de Oro.

asr-002493
02:15:52.860 --> 02:15:56.580
DAR Undersecretary for Legal Affairs Atty. Napoleon U. Galit: Patuloy po ang mandato ng DAR sa pangangalap.

asr-002494
02:15:57.000 --> 02:16:18.840
DAR Undersecretary for Legal Affairs Atty. Napoleon U. Galit: ng lupa ng mga government-owned land, kasi iyan po ay inuutos din sa amin ng ating Pangulo kung kaya siya ay nag-issue ng tinatawag natin na Administrative Order 22, Series of 2024, na tinatawag po natin na Coordinating Agency, na siya nag-iimbintorin ng mga government-owned lands.

asr-002495
02:16:18.840 --> 02:16:26.840
DAR Undersecretary for Legal Affairs Atty. Napoleon U. Galit: Now, mapatungkol po doon sa kung ilan na po ang government-owned lands na naano ng DAR na iimbintorin.

asr-002496
02:16:27.000 --> 02:16:42.180
DAR Undersecretary for Legal Affairs Atty. Napoleon U. Galit: Ang nakakaalam po niya na Honorable Congress Lady, walang iba kundi ang aming Undersecretary po ipoo-oo kung pupwede pong matanong natin si Undersecretary Kissel Celesti.

asr-002497
02:16:46.600 --> 02:16:47.480
